even be appropriate for the chronicle?<br /> <br /> I honestly don't know what legacy I want, but I don't want to pick one just for the extra ruling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T11:09:10-08:00","id":1047785,"title":"","content":"Khvarenah is an astrologer, right? I think astronomy comes pretty close. This implies Celestial Navigators (astronomy, Space) or Stewards of Celestial Orrery (astrology, Time).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T11:18:55-08:00","id":1047788,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure about the effect of my Nimbus (except Tilt: -1 Dex), only that it should be based on dessication.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T11:52:24-08:00","id":1047798,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> For a mace, the stats you have marked now are good. And yeah you get 3 rotes of any dot level, that's a leftover from the edition switch.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> True Friend for your Familiar is fine. Is Urbi your Mentor as well, or is that someone else? The spell you're thinking of is Life 2 Purge Illness. I'm gonna say that it's Lasting, with the caveat that the Attainment/spell only works once per disease/person unless you raise Potency. You can't just keep chipping away at the disease's severity as an instant action until it fades, you either need to boost Potency with a new casting or get Life 3. I'm gonna say there's a Life 3 version of Clear Thoughts that has the same effect on physical Conditions/Tilts and illnesses, IE, you can suppress/resolve them entirely with Reach.<br /> <br /> For the alchemy spell, use MagicSwordsman's Brew Potion. I have vague ideas brewing for a Legacy based around Serket, minor goddess (I love lesser deities and unpopular cults) of scorpion stings, magic, medicine, etc. Potions as an evolution of the concept of a scorpion injecting poison. Does that sound alright, or did you have a different theme in mind?<br /> <br /> What does your Obsession mean? IE, when would you gain Arcane Beats or get a Scrutiny bonus for it? Also is your &quot;find a McGuffin&quot; aspiration meant to just be &quot;find something of the ST's choice,&quot; or did you have something of your own in mind? If it's my choice, that's fine, that will be the focus of the first chapter.<br /> <br /> Your nimbus being &quot;based on dessication&quot; is plenty, you can describe it more when it comes up in play if you like. Don't overthink it!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> You're more than welcome to hold off on joining a Legacy until you find one in-game that looks interesting to you! There's going to be some interesting magical stuff involving stargazing in this game that might push you in one direction or another.<br /> <br /> The Thrice-Great are actually mentioned in the chapter, they're a very new Legacy associated with Weret-Hekau primarily. Technically Hermeticism won't develop for another 500 years, but the ideas aren't totally foreign in this period, at least among multicultural Awakened sorcerers like you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T12:19:55-08:00","id":1047808,"title":"","content":"I will do my character at some point on Monday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T12:33:23-08:00","id":1047815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Silver_Smoulder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1047808#post1047808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will do my character at some point on Monday.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No rush, take your time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T15:38:11-08:00","id":1047936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tambov</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1047779#post1047779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar10396_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"10396\" data-vbnamecard=\"10396\">Woland</a>, you have 5 more merit dots to spend.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, you're right. fixed.<br /> <br /> As <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> did, let me paste the Nimbus stuff here:<br /> <br /> <b>Long-term Nimbus:</b> Approaching Tempest - shadows become deeper, strong emotions are slightly dampened, random people speak in whispers without realizing it. <b>Immediate Nimbus: </b>Battlefield - His shadow grows a tail, horns and leathery wings. Sounds of raging battle rise from all directions and strands of fire burst from his fingers.<br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt:</b> Muddied Waters - Thoughts flow slower than usual and the joints are like liquid, resulting in a general numbness of body and mind. -1 Wits and -1 Dexterity <br /> <b>Signature Nimbus: </b>Cinders - A sudden taste of ash in one's mouth, whispers audible enough to notice, but not enough to make out words. A smell of burnt charcoal in the air.<br /> <br /> Again, a link to the <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2ex3DicLU7gRlRrVlpob3pKUlE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">sheet</a><br /> <br /> As for the Legacy, well, I like what 21C Hermit has done with its Attainments (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/158192-what-s-your-custom-legacy/page20\">link</a>). I'd like to replace those from Legacies: the Sublime, because the latter relied heavily on how Vices, derangements and Flaws worked pre-CofD, that is to say: completely different than they do now.<br /> However, it lacks a final touch so here's my take on it.<br /> <br /> 1st Attainment: Works as described, it has no prerequisites other than the initiation.<br /> 2nd Attainment: &quot;Spiritual Diving&quot;. Requirements: Spirit 2, Occult 3<br /> 3rd Attainment: &quot;Subjugate Sin&quot; Requirements: Spirit 3, Occult 3, Intimidation/Subterfuge 3; Optional Effect - the Goetia has to fulfill the task to the best of its ability, regardless of how much time or effort it takes, unless fullfilling the task would objectively equal the entity's destruction.<br /> 4th Attainment: &quot;Coalesce Sin&quot;, works as described. Prerequisites: Spirit 4, Occult 3, and both Intimidation and Subterfuge 3<br /> 5th Attainment: &quot;Demonic Servant&quot;, works as described, Prerequisites as for 4th and Athletics 3<br /> <br /> Suggested oblations: Flagellation. Hunting for a predatory animal. Dueling. Contemplating stories involving struggle. Playing games of strategy.<br /> <br /> My chartacter stumbled upon te Binders of Daevas after he prevented a coven of zoroastrian priests from being killed and their temple ransacked by overzealous soldiers. Convinced at least some of those people were Awakened like him and that there were vaulable Artifacts and texts inside, he bullshitted them and exploited his rank just long enough for the priests to flee with whatever was in the temple. Some time later he started receiving messages in Persian - sometimes on pieces of parchment, sometimes written on stones with blood - about the Legacy's doctrine and practices. The messages are not signed and any attempt to locate the sender(s) failed so far.<br /> <br /> Tell me if you want me to change something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T16:32:09-08:00","id":1047981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1047464#post1047464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That reminds me, anyone starting in a Legacy: were you initiated by a tutor, or did you learn/steal it from a grimoire/soul stone/stolen soul? A tutor is the most common option, and if you go that route, you can earn an arcane beat once per chapter by interacting with your tutor. If you were initiated by a tutor, give me their shadow name and a sentence or two about who they are and where they're based.</div> </div> </div> </div>After the Awakening he traveled back to Memphis and he began to see that a dark robed man was following him. Rounding a corner and hiding he ambushed the man, nearly beating him to unconsciousness. He begged for his life and then explained that he was sent by his master Shadowwalker. Leading him back to his master, Shadowwalker explained that he received a vision from his Lord Anpu to teach you the ways of a Namer. &quot;We are those consigned by our Lord to record the names of the living and the dead&quot; he explained. Remembering that Anpu had mentioned that he was to collect the Names of the dead he had no choice but to learn. Shadowwalker and Strife have become good friends. As Shadowwalker roams the world recording names his abilities allows him to walk in Strife's dreams where they talk often.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T10:03:39-08:00","id":1048296,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar10396_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"10396\" data-vbnamecard=\"10396\">Woland</a> I like that Clavicularius writeup. Couple questions: with the 1st attainment, how do you see the goetia manifesting? Is it just a whisper in your ear, or are passing animals and statues suddenly talking to you (and only you) sometimes, or is there a shift in the camera angle and suddenly a Vice-demon is lurking behind you in Twilight? Like, is it purely inside your head at this level, or does it have an external presence that other Mind mages can see and affect?<br /> <br /> With the 2nd attainment, is there now a &quot;physical&quot; presence in Twilight that sticks within a few yards of you? I'm also not sure about that &quot;Spirits may not be able to affect or perceive it&quot; part, that's kinda the point of Gossamer Touch. And about the Dream Reaching attainment: I like the idea, but what is the Social Maneuvering attempting to accomplish? I can imagine the demon trying to change your behavior, but what would you want from the demon?<br /> <br /> Those oblations are solid, although &quot;contemplating stories&quot; is a little passive. Maybe reciting a story of struggle to an audience, or listening to someone else's story, which might have developed from the whole Karpani poem-singing practice but you can take in a new direction. Think of 4-5 Yantras too, like the example ones for the Eleventh Question. The rule of thumb is that something you can do as an Instant action without a roll gives +1, and a more time-consuming action or one that requires a roll or grants a negative Condition gives +2. Maybe casting a spell in defiance of your Vice gives +1, or +2 if you make a Gnosis+Mind-Resolve roll to overcome your demon and provoke Nemesis if you fail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T13:08:21-08:00","id":1048400,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2207\" data-vbnamecard=\"2207\">Caladriu</a> <br /> 1st Attainment: No, it's purely internal. After all, a mage talking to a Goetia is most likely (as in this case) basically talking to himself.<br /> <br /> 2nd Attainment: Yes, exactly, and that presence kinda looks like the slasher movie version of me - imposing posture, torn, bloodied clothes, sharp metal protruding from body, the works. As for the &quot;affect of perceive&quot; part, when I read it I assumed that it might imply that the Goetia may be able to use Numina on spirits, deal damage or otherwise affect them without the spirits being able to fight back unless they possess a specific trait, power or something. It's likely I am wrong, as there has been quite a lot written on ephemeral entities over the years and game lines and I'm not even close to knowing all of it. It may be best to erase that sentence to avoid confusion. <br /> Dream Reaching: The demon may be persuaded, coerced or deceived into partaking its knowledge on the Astral Realms (or acting as a guide, should the need arise), becoming a more willing helper (for example voluntarily allowing complex commands on the 3rd Attainment, without the need to be seduced by a Vice) or performing some menial mental tasks (analyzing all possible strategies and processing data, while the mage does the creative work). Hell, if nothing else the demon may serve as a sparing partner for Physical/Social Skills, providing an in-game explanation of why dots in them rise despite lack of use.<br /> <br /> The oblation of listening to someone else's story sounds good, let's have it.<br /> <br /> Possible Yantras: Casting a spell in defiance of Vice (+1, or +2 if you make a Gnosis+Mind-Resolve roll to overcome the demon and provoke Nemesis on failure), Gathering trivia on the spell's target [an extendedaction/opposed roll] (+2), writing the demon's name in High Speech on sand, then erasing it (+1), Dealing damage to the target or opening at least one of his Doors in the same scene (+2)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T17:55:40-08:00","id":1048507,"title":"","content":"I am nearly done, just need to pick praxis and I should be done.<br /> <br /> There are two questions however:<br /> How much of our magic can we have cast in the background? Could I start with long term spells defense spells already cast? How do you want us to report the calculations? What assets would we have? For example, does our mentor have access to verges we could use?<br /> <br /> How much do equipment bonuses cost in resources dots? Using shifting the odds I can find specific items or give myself phantom dots of some merits like resources. So ideally I would combine those so I could use the money to buy nice things which would then last after the spell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T18:51:17-08:00","id":1048529,"title":"","content":"No starting spells, it all has to happen onscreen. I've run it the other way before, and I think this is more fun and makes resources more valuable. I might modify that later with the Patron merit, but for now assume that you're starting out empty.<br /> <br /> You're going to get a chance to use shifting the odds in that way right out of the gate, actually, so good catch. Rule of thumb is that equipment provides a dice bonus equal to Availability, even though some example equipment varies from that.<br /> <br /> When using magic to buy equipment with merits, your spell probably needs to have a Duration in the week-month range depending on how long you expect to stick around in the area. If coins turn back into leaves or a Mind/Fate whammy fades while you're still around, you're going to deal with angry Sleepers. That's how you get hunters, people!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T21:03:18-08:00","id":1048572,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7l8hQ-8p1dVQ21WVmx5VVdjUHM/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Here is a link to the sheet</a><br /> <br /> Merit Spending:<br /> 5: Gnosis 3<br /> 5: Gnosis 4<br /> <br /> XP Spending<br /> 5: Gnosis 5<br /> 4: Fate 4<br /> 4: Fate 5<br /> 2: Merit: Shadowname<br /> <br /> I would appreciate any help in converting the Celestial Masters legacy. I might not meet the Matter/Forces requirements so couldn't join it right now anyway. I have one less praxis to reflect that it is going to be used to duplicate the first attainment.<br /> <br /> Also, I wasn't really sure about picking my praxis. I tried to get a mix of things I would be using all the time so that I could hopefully get exceptionally successes and things that are resisted. I should perhaps have picked a lower level Fate spell though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-14-2017, 12:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T21:12:37-08:00","id":1048576,"title":"","content":"I was wondering if anyone would take the XP and run with it for all magic. I'm okay with Gnosis 5, but could you keep Fate at 4? I'd like mastery to be a slightly bigger deal and a milestone to achieve in play, although you can definitely be on the cusp of it.<br /> <br /> Suggestion: astrology and astronomy aren't really separate disciplines at this time. Maybe get the Interdisciplinary Specialty merit from the CofD core? Also I think you should have 5 praxes, not 4.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T21:21:17-08:00","id":1048578,"title":"","content":"Going to go out on a limb and assume gnosis 6 would be too much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Interdisciplinary Speciality looks appropriate (I could have sworn it used to only make it apply to one other skill. Much improved if so)<br /> <br /> Given the science requirements of the Celestial masters and the fact that those seem to scale with new legacies, should I switch those ratings do you think?<br /> <br /> <br /> Fate was actually part of the reason for that. You can give yourself a lot of merits making it really easy to be unattached and just pick up what you need where you happen to be. On the one hand, yay Fate magic. On the other hand, feelings of isolation and being something of a fraud.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-14-2017, 12:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T21:23:27-08:00","id":1048579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1048572#post1048572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would appreciate any help in converting the Celestial Masters legacy. I might not meet the Matter/Forces requirements so couldn't join it right now anyway. I have one less praxis to reflect that it is going to be used to duplicate the first attainment.<br /> <br /> Also, I wasn't really sure about picking my praxis. I tried to get a mix of things I would be using all the time so that I could hopefully get exceptionally successes and things that are resisted. I should perhaps have picked a lower level Fate spell though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll give some ideas on the Masters tomorrow. Khvarenah is actually pretty similar in some specific ways to a PC in my home game (high gnosis zoroastrian stargazer-scientist who uses serendipity all the damn time, grumble grumble) so I have thoughts on how to adapt them. In that modern setting we had some really good roleplaying with the Obrimos scientist PC contrasting her very literal views on astronomy with an old school Thrice Great astrologer occultist, although that science/occultism gap isn't really a thing in this era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T21:27:25-08:00","id":1048580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1048579#post1048579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll give some ideas on the Masters tomorrow. Khvarenah is actually pretty similar in some specific ways to a PC in my home game (high gnosis zoroastrian stargazer-scientist who uses serendipity all the damn time, grumble grumble) so I have thoughts on how to adapt them. In that modern setting we had some really good roleplaying with the Obrimos scientist PC contrasting her very literal views on astronomy with an old school Thrice Great astrologer occultist, although that science/occultism gap isn't really a thing in this era.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you, I really do appreciate it since I don't really have a sense of legacy balance.<br /> <br /> As for serendipity, that spell is amazing, especially at initiate level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-14-2017, 12:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T21:39:55-08:00","id":1048581,"title":"","content":"It's real good as a player, but as a DM it was kinda annoying for the onus to always be on me to come up with how the mage could use Science to solve X thing, and also that I could almost never put them in a situation where they were rolling a low/0 rated skill. My worry with Fate is that it sometimes homogenizes the game by letting you roll with 5 dot skills and big equipment bonuses every time, without a clear sense of where that comes from.<br /> <br /> I dunno, it's a challenge I can work with. I'll just get creative with ways to counter that and keep you on your toes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T22:37:27-08:00","id":1048592,"title":"","content":"You could always put the onus on the player to explain how it applies. Hopefully, Academics should be easier, since &quot;I read about X in a book once&quot; can explain most everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T02:01:09-08:00","id":1048633,"title":"","content":"I haven't got much done yet but this is what I was thinking for the Celestial Masters. It can be a starting place for us to work from. I tried to match Attainment 2, 4, &amp; 5 to the write-up for the Celestial Master in the book &quot;Keys to the Supernal Tarot&quot;, page 39 - 44. The book only had the 3 attainments so i had to add the first and the third to try and fit the theme as well as add an optional for the second attainment.<br /> <br /> <b>First Attainment:</b> Supernal Sight (Custom)<br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Initiation (Gnosis 2, Forces 2 &amp; Matter 2)<br /> Night Vision &amp; Detect Substance (Instant Casting)<br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b> Space 2<br /> Ground-Eater (Instant Casting)<br /> <br /> <b>Second Attainment:</b> Celestial Telescope <b>(From the book &quot;Keys to the Supernal Tarot&quot;, page 42)</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 2, Forces 2 &amp; Matter 2.<br /> Zoom in &amp; Machine invisibility (See Through matter only) (Instant Cast)<br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b> Space 2.<br /> Outward and Inward Eye (Instant Casting)<br /> <br /> <b>Third Attainment:</b> Shifting Senses (Custom)<br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 4, Forces 3 &amp; Matter 3.<br /> Intensify Energy (Custom) &amp; Shrink and Grow (instant Casting)<br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b> Space 3<br /> Locate Object (Instant Casting, Spell Specific, Advanced Duration)<br /> <br /> <b>Fourth Attainment:</b> Everything is Stardust <b>(From the book &quot;Keys to the Supernal Tarot&quot;, page 43)</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 6, Forces 4 &amp; Matter 4.<br /> Matter to energy, Energy to Matter. (Very limited Transform Energy &amp; Transubstantiation)<br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b> Space 4<br /> Scrying (Instant Cast, Advanced Duration, Sensory)<br /> <br /> <b>Fifth Attainment:</b> Light Long Dead <b>(From the book &quot;Keys to the Supernal Tarot&quot;, page 44)</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 8, Forces 5 &amp; Matter 5.<br /> Transform Energy &amp; Transubstantiation (Instant Casting, Spell Specific)<br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b> Space 5<br /> Teleportation (Instant Cast, Sensory)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">If I did end up going Obrimos going as a Celestial Masters (Celestial Navigators) would take him way from being a warrior so i would need to find a Legacy that is Obrimos and a warrior.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-14-2017, 05:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T07:24:43-08:00","id":1048737,"title":"","content":"Okay, looks like I'm about done. Give me a checkthrough?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T09:08:48-08:00","id":1048772,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> The default &quot;Obrimos warrior&quot; Legacy is the ever-popular Perfected Adepts from the 1E core book, primary arcanum is Life. You also might check out the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\">Choir of Hashmallim</a>, who focus on fighting the Abyss (or Apep/Chaos in this era) and summoning an angel to fight with them.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12852_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12852\" data-vbnamecard=\"12852\">Silver_Smoulder</a> Looks good! Y'all are starting with more Resources between you than I expected, but that's fine. The group is going to be quite wealthy. Where are you guys keeping all those heavy coins? I guess Prism could shrink them with Matter 3.<br /> <br /> At Gnosis 3, you should have 1 more Praxis. You should have Defense 5 (Wits/Dex 3+Athletics 2, that's new in 2E). You should have Willpower 5, Res 3 + Com 2. Your Mentor has 3 Skills, define them. Just to help me out, give me a few examples of situations during normal gameplay where you would gain an arcane beat for fulfilling &quot;Systemize Supernal Truth.&quot; Artifacts is a good Obsession- everyone should keep in mind that Aspirations and Obsessions are concrete mechanical things that you're expected to hit fairly often, not unlike Virtue/Vice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T09:43:36-08:00","id":1048791,"title":"","content":"I can't see her sheet on my phone if she went Obrimos then I don't need to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T09:52:28-08:00","id":1048795,"title":"","content":"Silver's character is Obrimos, yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T10:01:38-08:00","id":1048798,"title":"","content":"Ok then I can stay Moros, unless I am needed to change to get the 5th path. Thyros (SP?).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T10:08:47-08:00","id":1048807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1048772#post1048772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where are you guys keeping all those heavy coins?</div> </div> </div> </div>In other people's pockets of course! Why carry them around when they just come to you when you need them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T10:21:16-08:00","id":1048814,"title":"","content":"I have a cart .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T10:32:18-08:00","id":1048818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1048807#post1048807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In other people's pockets of course! Why carry them around when they just come to you when you need them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hold it, bucko. That would be a (perfectly reasonable, assuming enough wealth exists nearby) Fate spell, whereas buying the actual Resources merit means you're responsible for the coins yourself.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> You can stick with Moros.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 02-14-2017, 01:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T11:05:22-08:00","id":1048830,"title":"","content":"Wait... I can afford Space 3. We can keep all the money at our safe space and commute to wherever we are working.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T11:45:54-08:00","id":1048845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1047798#post1047798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> True Friend for your Familiar is fine. Is Urbi your Mentor as well, or is that someone else? The spell you're thinking of is Life 2 Purge Illness. I'm gonna say that it's Lasting, with the caveat that the Attainment/spell only works once per disease/person unless you raise Potency. You can't just keep chipping away at the disease's severity as an instant action until it fades, you either need to boost Potency with a new casting or get Life 3. I'm gonna say there's a Life 3 version of Clear Thoughts that has the same effect on physical Conditions/Tilts and illnesses, IE, you can suppress/resolve them entirely with Reach.<br /> <br /> For the alchemy spell, use MagicSwordsman's Brew Potion. I have vague ideas brewing for a Legacy based around Serket, minor goddess (I love lesser deities and unpopular cults) of scorpion stings, magic, medicine, etc. Potions as an evolution of the concept of a scorpion injecting poison. Does that sound alright, or did you have a different theme in mind?<br /> <br /> What does your Obsession mean? IE, when would you gain Arcane Beats or get a Scrutiny bonus for it? Also is your &quot;find a McGuffin&quot; aspiration meant to just be &quot;find something of the ST's choice,&quot; or did you have something of your own in mind? If it's my choice, that's fine, that will be the focus of the first chapter.<br /> <br /> Your nimbus being &quot;based on dessication&quot; is plenty, you can describe it more when it comes up in play if you like. Don't overthink it!<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>The ruling on Purge Illness is fine.<br /> No, Urbi is not my Mentor. That's either my Legacy tutor or the Mage who bound her as my Familiar, or maybe both in one person.<br /> I've changed the spell name accordingly. I kept the rote Skill as Science, as Alchemy still falls under it in the time. Is this fine?<br /> I changed Obsession to &quot;magical properties of matter&quot; is this better?<br /> <br /> Link again: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ozelns5abilsix2/Imhotep.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/ozelns5abi...hotep.pdf?dl=0</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T11:47:13-08:00","id":1048846,"title":"","content":"My original earliest germ of a campaign idea involved you guys either having Space teleportation and/or some sort of interesting Artifact with a similar effect, so no objections here. Only caveat: you're not going to start with a magically secured place that you established offscreen, you're gonna need to actually find and secure one in play. Trust me, it's more enjoyable this way. You also may want to consider spending that XP elsewhere when you see my extremely based and rare Celestial Masters conversion! It's cobbled together from the Supernal Tarot original, <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?658166-Mage-the-Awakening-I-read-a-Legacy-a-day&amp;p=16097605#post16097605\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> alternative 1E version, and Hardwire's writeup. Here's the mechanical bones of it:<br /> <br /> <b>Celestial Masters</b><br /> Parent Tradition: Obrimos or Karpani<br /> Primary Arcanum: Forces<br /> <br /> 1st Attainment: Nightvision (Forces 1)<br /> optional: based on Outward Inward Eye (Space 1), reduces range/cover penalties but no 360 vision<br /> <br /> 2nd Attainment: Zoom In (Forces 2)<br /> optional: Scrying (Space 2)<br /> <br /> 3rd Attainment: based on Shaping (Matter 2), creates a map of an area you see<br /> optional: complex effect based on locate object<br /> <br /> 4th Attainment: transform matter to energy<br /> optional: teleport<br /> <br /> 5th Attainment: transform matter to matter, and energy to energy<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T12:03:33-08:00","id":1048855,"title":"","content":"Since Space used to be the primary arcana, would you swap the space options with the main? Also, isn't Colocation 3dot now so more appropriate for the third attainment?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T12:28:45-08:00","id":1048869,"title":"","content":"The swapped when they changed from Celestial Navigators to Celestial Masters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T12:33:04-08:00","id":1048874,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> that's all good. In the era-appropriate spirit of Aristotelian unity of plot, go ahead and condense legacy mentor and Urbi binder into one person, give them a name and location and a sentence or two of description, and we'll be good.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> In the original writeup you had the choice of either Forces or Matter as primary. I'll look at the attainments again when I get a chance, taking Space as your third ruling arcanum is probably fine but there's a couple effects where Space is clearly an optional boost to a primarily Matter or Forces power. I think I picked Teleport over Co-Location because the latter interacts with attainments' preset spell factors in a weird way, but I'll look at it more closely later.<br /> <br /> Also technically the Celestial Navigators aren't a thing until the 15th century, the one-sentence writeup in Dark Eras suggests that the current incarnation is a different thing that will later be rediscovered. So don't worry overly much about the background presented in Supernal Tarot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 02-14-2017, 03:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T12:37:07-08:00","id":1048877,"title":"","content":"So, for my Merit points:<br /> 2 into Great Cult Status<br /> 4 into Resources<br /> 2 into Mentor (specialty of Academics, Crafts, Science)<br /> 2 into Professional Training: Siege Engineer<br /> <br /> XP:<br /> 5 into Gnosis<br /> 4 into Prime 4<br /> 4 into Matter 3<br /> 1 into Rote: Silver Fire<br /> 1 into Rote: Shape Matter<br /> <br /> Systematize the Supernal is that essentially, the Supernal world and its manifestation in the Fallen World is essentially arbitrary. So, as a Gnostikon, it's my duty to basically look for patterns, and the coal of that is to find a causal relationship between a Supernal effect or interaction causing a Fallen World effect or interaction.,<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.mediafire.com/file/4waaow88oli7q48/Antikatoprismos.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T12:53:47-08:00","id":1048891,"title":"","content":"I'm tracking you, but that's a bit broad! Looking for relationships between Supernal and Fallen effects is what you do every time you turn on Mage Sight. Good Obsessions refer to pretty specific things like &quot;experiment with Perfecting Death spells&quot; or &quot;breaking codes and encryption&quot; or &quot;how do vampires work.&quot; If those Obsessions emerge from phenomena your PC has actually encountered or heard about during play, all the better. I find as an ST it's really difficult to trigger your Obsessions if they don't refer to things you can &quot;grab&quot; with a dice roll, if that makes sense.<br /> <br /> I like &quot;finding patterns&quot;- what about looking for magical significance in natural and artificial patterns? That gives you things you can Scrutinize and investigate, and gives me stuff I can throw at you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T13:37:47-08:00","id":1048908,"title":"","content":"Hmm, not quite what I meant. Basically, since I'm super salty about the hideous goblins who excised Atlantis out of Mage, what I essentially want my character to do is to work out a framework that can encompass all of the Supernal Events in one unified theory. Kind of how we can describe 90% of modern physics with the Standard Model, or how all of Mage 1E fit neatly within the Atlantean myth.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying it should be Atlantis, but it should be something where I can go: &quot;Okay, so there's the fact that we all speak a common language, and then there's the fact that we have similar hand motions when invoking Spell A - so there must've been an original progenitor.&quot;<br /> <br /> But if you want me to come up with something else, I can come up with something else. Like, for example, when he Awakened, Antikatoprismos heard an amazing song echoing from the Watchtower, so now he seeks to re-create it in the Fallen World.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T14:27:00-08:00","id":1048934,"title":"","content":"Speaking of Aspirations/Obsessions, how would you like us to indicate more specific or detailed aspects? For example, I would really like to have a conversation with a Decieved (Restless Stars, Fate, etc.) It technically falls into his second Aspiration about other worldviews and his first given Irem did a number on the sky (though are not alone in it).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12852_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12852\" data-vbnamecard=\"12852\">Silver_Smoulder</a> So you want your PC to develop the Atlantis story as presented in Mage 2E core which would be used by the future diamond orders? Imperial Mysteries already squared the circle as far as Atlantis being real is concerned. (Though I STRONGLY doubt any of us will become archmasters since it changes the scale of hte game, and possibly even the game itself.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T14:40:31-08:00","id":1048945,"title":"","content":"They may have squared the circle, but I will Immanentize the Eschaton and make it work, OOC.<br /> <br /> IC, it doesn't have to be Atlantis, it can be anything else.<br /> <br /> Though I question to see where it says in IM that Atlantis is out? I see the part where it says that it's one of the options, that the Exarchs and Oracles used Time to basically phase it in an out of existence, but then from the objective viewpoint, the fact that we have Exarchs and Oracles who war over Atlantis being a thing makes it true.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T14:59:59-08:00","id":1048952,"title":"","content":"Ok looking everything over it looks like we have all 10 Arcana covered, listed below is the highest rating we have in the different Arcana. Nicely done all.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Death 3<br /> Fate 5</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Forces 1<br /> Life 2</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Matter 3<br /> Mind 3</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Prime 4<br /> Space 2</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Spirit 2<br /> Time 1</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T15:04:41-08:00","id":1048955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1048952#post1048952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Death 3<br /> Fate 4<br /> Forces 1<br /> Life 2<br /> Matter 3<br /> Mind 3<br /> Prime 4<br /> Space 3<br /> Spirit 2<br /> Time 1</div> </div> </div> </div>Updated the numbers. I was asked to reduce Fate and used it to bump up Space.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-14-2017, 06:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T15:09:26-08:00","id":1048957,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> Without spoiling anything, let me just say that I picked up on the Irem connection in that Obsession and I've got you covered. In general, if you guys want to encounter/accomplish some specific thing, just tell me! I want to fill the game with stuff that interest the PCs. This is a good use of Aspirations too: &quot;Meet one of the Deceived&quot; is a <b>great </b>specific Aspiration that tells me what you want to do as a player, aim for specific (even if it's long-term) stuff like that more than &quot;become a famous wizard.&quot; Also, once you encounter specific things in game that interest you, you can switch out your Obsessions for new ones.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12852_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12852\" data-vbnamecard=\"12852\">Silver_Smoulder</a> I think we got our wires crossed a little: what you're describing is a totally fine Obsession, and one that a lot of mages in this era share and will want to discuss with you! That's the big picture thing happening in To the Strongest, the transition from lots of different cultural traditions of magic to &quot;hey it seems like we're all doing the same thing.&quot; Just to be clear, it's not <i>currently </i>the mainstream belief that all mages descend from a single lost empire (called Atlantis by some), but it <i>will become </i>the mainstream belief going forward, possibly within your PCs' lifetimes. Like, the dialogues in which Plato invented the Atlantis myth were written 30 years ago, you can go to the Academy and ask his students about it. Your PC can definitely be investigating and sharing theories with others about that, and I'll throw lost ruins and weird High Speech runes at you to help it along with arcane beats.<br /> <br /> Let me quote this sidebar for everybody:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dark Eras 79</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Alexandrian Mage Quick Reference</b><br /> Creating a mage in Alexander\u2019s time is mostly a<br /> matter of following the normal rules in Mage:<br /> The Awakening. The following differences and<br /> new names bring the game to this period. Greek<br /> is the preferred language, as it was in Alexander\u2019s<br /> empire.<br /> <b>Mages, Magi:</b> The term \u201cmage\u201d is entirely out<br /> of character. The terms \u201cmagos\u201d and \u201cmagi\u201d are<br /> recent Persian imports that would be understood<br /> in the proper context by experienced Awakened<br /> travelers. Awakened refer to themselves by a<br /> variety of other names depending on culture \u2014<br /> usually some variant of \u201csorcerer\u201d or \u201cpriest.\u201d<br /> <b>Other Terms:</b> Greek mages speak of <b>Pneuma</b>,<br /> not Mana, and the term enters general use<br /> throughout the Empire. Instead of Paradox, many<br /> speak of <b>Nemesis</b>. They treat <b>High Speech</b> as<br /> an enlightened meta-language, not a common<br /> heritage from some shadowy first civilization.<br /> <b>Paths:</b> Mages belong to Paths as usual, but overt<br /> visions of Watchtowers rarely accompany their<br /> Awakenings. They travel to sacred places for<br /> magical revelations, or go on inward journeys<br /> through the myths they know.<br /> <b>Arcana:</b> The word \u201cArcana\u201d is Latin. Greek<br /> mages master <b>Archai</b> (singular, Arche).<br /> <b>Orders: </b>Instead of \u201cOrders,\u201d sorcerers adhere<br /> to one of four <b>darshanas</b>, or schools of esoteric<br /> philosophy that have spontaneously formed<br /> among Awakened of different cultures. These<br /> provide rote skills. In addition, Awakened usually<br /> belong to a <b>Cult</b> from their own culture, which<br /> provides additional oblations, Legacy access, and<br /> a guiding mythology.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let me quote this one as well since it's highly relevant and explains how the individual Cults generally view the lost ruins of the past, where Artifacts come from, why mortals talk about a bygone age of heroes and gods and monsters, etc.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Ages of Humanity</b><br /> <br /> Most Greek sorcerers believe in the Hesiodic theory of ages, below.<br /> <br /> <b>Golden Age:</b> Humans and gods freely mingled. All humans were Awakened, with magical daemons<br /> inhabiting perfect bodies. Mages believe this was a world where the Shadow, Astral, and material<br /> planes were one realm. This ended with the Titanomachy, when Zeus overthrew Cronus.<br /> <br /> <b>Silver Age:</b> Humans lived in childlike ignorance, lulled to Sleep by the gods. When they rebelled, Zeus<br /> destroyed them, but their wild souls became spirits in the Shadow.<br /> <br /> <b>Bronze Age:</b> People in this time are said to be \u201cbronze-clad\u201d as a comment upon their inventiveness<br /> and violence. They lived in armored houses, wielded sharp weapons, and possessed minds and bodies<br /> honed for conflict. The Pelasgians reigned in Arcadia until Lycaeon served his own son as an offering<br /> to Zeus. The king of the gods obliterated the royal family and sent a flood to swallow the world. The<br /> spirits of this age were consigned to deepest Hades, and never permitted to walk the world as ghosts.<br /> Arcadian mages believe themselves heirs of the Bronze Age.<br /> <br /> <b>Heroic Age:</b> In this, the age of Troy and the Argonauts, heroes soared close to Golden Age virtue.<br /> They walked with gods and demigods, and founded all human nations before passing into Elysium. This<br /> age ended when the gods permitted heroes whom the gods had cursed for impiety to return from their<br /> adventures, their former powers diminished.<br /> <br /> <b>Iron Age:</b> The current age.<br /> <br /> Indian sorcerers mark similar ages through Vedic Yugas that last approximately 12,000 years each.<br /> <br /> <b>Satya Yuga:</b> The godlike humans of this age lived for 100,000 years. Toil was unknown, because<br /> these naturally Ascended people acquired anything they wished through will alone.<br /> <br /> <b>Treta Yuga: </b>The first flaws entered the human spirit, but humans still possessed tremendous power and<br /> innate Awakening. The gods sent avatars to protect the world, especially when Ravana, king of demons,<br /> conquered existence. Vishnu incarnated as Rama to liberate the world.<br /> <br /> <b>Dwapar Yuga: </b>Indian sorcerers claim a special knowledge of this age, the time of the Mahabharata.<br /> Men and women in this age had to strive to Awaken, but those who did possessed legendary powers,<br /> prompting the gods to entrust them with moral teachings for the age to come. People were as ambitious<br /> as they were mighty, however; their battles built culture, but annihilated their own greatness.<br /> <br /> <b>Kali Yuga:</b> The current age, where immorality reigns, and humans cannot Awaken without exceptional<br /> effort.<br /> <br /> With histories connected to mighty, ancient empires, Egyptians and Persians typically reckon time by<br /> dynasty, including the reigns of mythical rulers. Weret-Hekau lore records the reign of \u201cscorpion kings\u201d<br /> over 3,000 years ago, and Karpani know that before Zoroaster brought the fire of truth, Assyrians,<br /> Babylonians, and the half-devil Ki-En-Gir people reigned. Egyptians regard their nation as the mortal<br /> face of an eternal cosmos, but the Karpani believe that in the future, the powers of truth and deception will<br /> commit to a final struggle, spawning messiahs and witch-kings. Prophecy places this two millennia or more<br /> in the future, but Zoroaster warned that this time will pass swiftly, and the devout must prepare. Even half-blasphemous<br /> Karpani worry about the final age, especially after Alexander\u2019s epoch-breaking entrance. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 02-14-2017, 06:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T15:58:04-08:00","id":1048983,"title":"","content":"Ok What else do you need from us.<br /> <br /> Also do you have a preferred IC post header?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T17:14:28-08:00","id":1049026,"title":"","content":"Zoroastrian cosmology has a similar four age structure, with each age supposed to last 3000 years.<br /> <br /> First was the spiritual creation, when the Yazata and Amesha Spenta were created and Angra Mainyu miscreated counterparts. It ended when Angra Mainyu attacked but was repelled.<br /> <br /> Then there was the physical creation. In this world state there was no motion. It ended with the second attack of Angra Mainyu.<br /> <br /> The third age is when Angra Mainyu and its forces enter creation and become trapped within, doing much damage in the process.<br /> <br /> The final age, in which we live, began with the birth of Zarathustra and will end with the coming of a savior and the removal of evil from the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-14-2017, 08:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T19:02:42-08:00","id":1049086,"title":"","content":"Expect the IC thread tomorrow. Please copy/paste this header in your IC posts, it makes it way easier to track resources and what effects are active.<br /> <br /> <b>Shadow Name<br /> Peripheral Sight | Conditions: none | Spells: none<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 5/5 | Mana: 10/10</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Post that based on what your status is when you <b>start</b> your post. Free example!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>You</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <b>Caladriu<br /> Peripheral Sight | Conditions: none | Spells: none<br /> Health: </b>OOOOOOO | <b>Willpower: 5/5 | Mana: 10/10</b><br /> <br /> Caladriu mutters in High Speech and casts spells.<br /> ---<br /> <i>Spending 2 Willpower and 1 Mana, turning on Active Sight (Forces, Prime), activating Death Armor, casting Levitation (3 turn duration), taking 1 <b>resistant</b> bashing damage.</i></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Me</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Caladriu gets stabbed by the monster.<br /> ---<br /> <i>Caladriu takes 2 lethal and 1 bashing damage, and the Bleeding Tilt.</i></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>You</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Caladriu<br /> Active Sight (Forces, Prime) | Conditions: Bleeding | Spells: Death Armor, Levitation (2 turns left)<br /> Health: </b>LL<b>B</b>BOOO | Willpower: 3/5 | Mana: 9/10<br /> <br /> Aw, that sucks. Caladriu banishes Mage Sight and tries to...<br /> ---<br /> <i>Returning to Peripheral Sight, and...</i></div> </div> </div> </div>When you guys roll, link to your rolls on Orokos. Use the campaign name <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/c-To+The+Strongest\" target=\"_blank\">To The Strongest</a>. If you're rolling 5 dice, type 5d10h8. If you're rolling with 9-again, type 5d10o9h8. If it's a chance die, just type 1d10.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Here's some house rules: we're going to be using Group Beats, with a little boost. Whenever you guys accumulate 20 (not 25, 20) Beats total, you'll all get 1 Experience. No need to record your own Beats, they just go in the pot.<br /> <br /> In order to move things along, I'll sometimes apply bonuses or penalties after you guys roll, rather than doing a back and forth. For example, if you roll 6 dice and I tell you &quot;actually there would be -2 for that action&quot;, rather than have you reroll I'll just nix the last 2 dice in your roll, which might involve removing successes.<br /> <br /> Same reason: sometimes I'll make simple reflexive rolls on you guys' behalf, like a Wits+Composure perception check or rolling Initiative. I'll only do that when it makes my posts quicker and easier, it's never going to be life or death.<br /> <br /> I'm usually not going to post my own rolls on Orokos, I prefer to roll with my own dice, partly as a DM screen but mostly because I'm lazy and this is easier than linking to Orokos whenever I want to post.<br /> <br /> <b>Is that okay with you, or no?</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T19:41:25-08:00","id":1049102,"title":"","content":"Updated sheet and spending.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7l8hQ-8p1dVQ21WVmx5VVdjUHM/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Here is a link to the sheet</a><br /> <br /> Merit Spending:<br /> 5: Gnosis 3<br /> 5: Gnosis 4<br /> <br /> XP Spending<br /> 5: Gnosis 5<br /> 4: Fate 4<br /> 4: Space 3<br /> 2: Merit: Shadowname<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049086#post1049086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Is that okay with you, or no?</b></div> </div> </div> </div>That will be fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T22:57:54-08:00","id":1049156,"title":"","content":"Yep, that's all fine with me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T00:41:13-08:00","id":1049179,"title":"","content":"Ok what is Orokos? I go to the link above but to roll the dice I need to log in and it doesn't give a a place to sign up for an account or anything.<br /> <br /> Test<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\"