-moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/486175\" target=\"_blank\">Test2</a>: <u>3d10h8</u> <b>0</b></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Ok looks like I have it worked out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-15-2017, 04:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T10:19:01-08:00","id":1049351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1048874#post1048874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> that's all good. In the era-appropriate spirit of Aristotelian unity of plot, go ahead and condense legacy mentor and Urbi binder into one person, give them a name and location and a sentence or two of description, and we'll be good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mentor is Afti Heqnet Sekhmet (Brewer of Sekhmet's Beer), in Waset (Thebes, Egypt). A Thyrsos physician combining Kemetic medicine with Nubian folk remedies.<br /> <br /> Sheets:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ozelns5abilsix2/Imhotep.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Imhotep</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/lhdka91qp5o3y10/Urbi.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Urbi</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/x2p449z7q56mtbh/Urbi%27s%20body.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Urbi's body</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#40D080\">Also, dibs on cyan.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T11:20:37-08:00","id":1049381,"title":"","content":"If we are doing colors, I will take <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">dark blue.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T11:42:46-08:00","id":1049391,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#800080\">Grabbing purple. </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T11:44:02-08:00","id":1049392,"title":"","content":"Just green.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T12:24:10-08:00","id":1049419,"title":"","content":"Working on the IC thread now. Last couple things:<br /> <br /> Your Patron goes by the Shadow Name of <b>Ratri</b>, or &quot;Night.&quot; She's a teacher and scholar of the Jnanashakti who passes in and out of Alexander's courts and camps now that his advance has stalled in the last 3 years. In the tradition of the <i>Acarya </i>wandering mentors of the Mantra Sadhaki, she prefers to travel a semi-consistent cycle of known Hallows and Verges and other landmarks rather than stay in one permanent Sanctum, and each of you traveled with her (sometimes in groups, sometimes alone, depending) for a while and learned magical lessons as they came up. She tends to prefer riddles, Socratic questioning, and leading students to auspicious situations where they will be able to answer their own problems. She's friendly, and you are important to her, but so are a lot of other things in this world- you get the sense that she has a lot of irons in the fire lately.<br /> <br /> You aren't actually sure what Path she is, and she doesn't often cast her own spells directly. When asked, she claims to walk &quot;the Path of Smoke,&quot; which makes nearby Mantrikis hum and nod knowingly. Her main magical interests are the hidden worlds, their denizens, and complex mechanisms and artifices.<br /> <br /> Also, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a>, who do you want to control your Retainer/Familiar? I was thinking you can tell me what you want them to do (generally or specifically), and I'll roll the dice and sometimes control them if it would be more interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T13:16:33-08:00","id":1049444,"title":"","content":"That sounds appropriate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T13:51:35-08:00","id":1049459,"title":"","content":"Thread is up: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1049458-ic-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...-the-strongest</a><br /> <br /> More details later, but you can check in for right now and decide where you want to go or do. Getting more information and planning a longer trip would be a good start- maybe you could send Kemsit to get a shopping list together.<br /> <br /> Start with full Willpower and half (round up) Mana, Artifacts have full Mana, Familiars have half (round up) Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T14:15:52-08:00","id":1049479,"title":"","content":"What time of year is it, can we expect a cool evening or a chilly evening?<br /> <br /> <br /> Looks like I will be Dark Red as it shoes up better than the green.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-15-2017, 05:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T14:43:37-08:00","id":1049505,"title":"","content":"It's February and you're in the desert, so temperatures will get extreme- something to think about for the expedition. It's getting pretty chilly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T14:57:39-08:00","id":1049514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049505#post1049505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's February and you're in the desert, so temperatures will get extreme- something to think about for the expedition. It's getting pretty chilly.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That is why I wanted to know. Thanks. Also it is this time of year in the desert that reptiles and insects are trying to stay warm at night so be careful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T21:01:30-08:00","id":1049676,"title":"","content":"Suppose I take some clay and fashion it into a votive statue, retaining a small part for future use. Then have the caravan leave the offering as a gift at their next destination. How strong a sympathetic link would there be between the statue and the piece I kept?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-16-2017, 01:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T09:08:30-08:00","id":1049880,"title":"","content":"Khvarenah would have a Medium connection to the statue he created, and could use the chunk of statue as a Material-level sympathy yantra. When you're using yantras to cast at sympathetic range (rather than sensory/touch when the target is right there), they take up a yantra slot but don't provide extra dice.<br /> <br /> It's going to be relevant soon, so here's the Resources/Availability rules. Once per chapter, you can expend the Resources merit to purchase an item or service with Availability equal to your Resources dots or dots-1. You can instead buy something of your Resources+1, but you have to reduce your Resources dots by 1 for the rest of the month. If something costs at least 2 dots less than your Resources, you can buy it without expending Resources for the chapter.<br /> <br /> For example, if you have Resources 3, you can buy as many Availability 1 items as you want, or you can expend the Merit for the chapter to buy one thing of Availability 2 or 3. Or you can buy something of Availability 4, and then have Resources 2 for the rest of the month.<br /> <br /> Instead of using Resources, if you have an appropriate Skill at a rating equal to or greater than Availability, you can procure the item with a single roll of Attribute+Skill-Availability. What counts as an appropriate skill depends on the context and how exactly you plan to get the item or service, but Larceny and Streetwise are usually good bets. You might also be able to convince someone to help with your relevant Animal Ken knowledge, or secure a precious item as a gift after formally Socializing with the owner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T09:42:19-08:00","id":1049897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049880#post1049880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Khvarenah would have a Medium connection to the statue he created, and could use the chunk of statue as a Material-level sympathy yantra. When you're using yantras to cast at sympathetic range (rather than sensory/touch when the target is right there), they take up a yantra slot but don't provide extra dice.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I have it now, thank you. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049880#post1049880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's going to be relevant soon, so here's the Resources/Availability rules. Once per chapter, you can expend the Resources merit to purchase an item or service with Availability equal to your Resources dots or dots-1. You can instead buy something of your Resources+1, but you have to reduce your Resources dots by 1 for the rest of the month. If something costs at least 2 dots less than your Resources, you can buy it without expending Resources for the chapter.<br /> <br /> For example, if you have Resources 3, you can buy as many Availability 1 items as you want, or you can expend the Merit for the chapter to buy one thing of Availability 2 or 3. Or you can buy something of Availability 4, and then have Resources 2 for the rest of the month.<br /> <br /> Instead of using Resources, if you have an appropriate Skill at a rating equal to or greater than Availability, you can procure the item with a single roll of Attribute+Skill-Availability. What counts as an appropriate skill depends on the context and how exactly you plan to get the item or service, but Larceny and Streetwise are usually good bets. You might also be able to convince someone to help with your relevant Animal Ken knowledge, or secure a precious item as a gift after formally Socializing with the owner.</div> </div> </div> </div>So if I use Fate magic to give myself resources then let it lapse and recast would that allow me to get around the cap?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T10:50:07-08:00","id":1049931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049897#post1049897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So if I use Fate magic to give myself resources then let it lapse and recast would that allow me to get around the cap?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, sorry. Also note how Shifting the Odds works: it doesn't add Merit dots directly, but gives the subject access to the Merit at level [Potency] or less. In the spirit of the spell-stacking restrictions on Attribute/Skill dots, I'm gonna say that this can only replace your subject's current Resources rating [which could be 0] with the spell's result. You can't have two or more instances of the same Resources merit.You could also, with a separate spellcasting, grant your subject Allies or Status or whatever.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar10396_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"10396\" data-vbnamecard=\"10396\">Woland</a> When you're rolling dice, if you type 5d10<b>h8</b> it will calculate successes for you, including 10-again.<br /> <br /> e: edited the first paragraph like 4 times, this is the final ruling I'm going with. I'm trying to interpret the rules in a way that respects the intent of the mundane systems the designers worked on, without denying you the big advantages that come with magic. You're going to be able to solve a lot of problems with magic, especially the kind that interacts with Merits, but I want to let you do that without bypassing those mechanics altogether.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 02-16-2017, 02:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T13:00:51-08:00","id":1050008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049931#post1049931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nope, sorry. Also note how Shifting the Odds works: it doesn't add Merit dots directly, but gives the subject access to the Merit at level [Potency] or less. In the spirit of the spell-stacking restrictions on Attribute/Skill dots, I'm gonna say that this can only replace your subject's current Resources rating [which could be 0] with the spell's result. You can't have two or more instances of the same Resources merit.You could also, with a separate spellcasting, grant your subject Allies or Status or whatever.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was more thinking that you spend a bunch of money, dismiss the spell, then cast it again. However, I understand the desire to not entirely remove the mundane mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T13:13:01-08:00","id":1050013,"title":"","content":"I get you! At least for this game, it's a case of Resources being an abstract dramatic measure of your PC's ability to affect the world using money during this Chapter, rather than a specific amount of coins. If you cast it again in the way you described, there just isn't enough loose money nearby to come your way right now, or Fate is unwilling to cooperate, or something.<br /> <br /> edit: oh yeah, the other restriction on letting it lapse is that if your Resources rating drops, that money goes away somehow. If you're still near the person you gave money to, they're gonna realize they got conned and you're gonna have trouble. This is why you'll want spells with a Duration of at least a week, depending on how long you expect to be around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 02-16-2017, 04:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T14:26:29-08:00","id":1050066,"title":"","content":"Ok then I overspent on merits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T22:22:36-08:00","id":1050324,"title":"","content":"Aaand here we go! This is where I was planning to start off, but I decided to let you guys settle in first. I find that a good hook for Mage is throwing an impossible problem at the PCs and seeing how you solve it.<br /> <br /> Before I forget, here's how starting equipment will work, besides your Dedicated Tool. Everyone pick 2 of these:<ul><li>A melee or ranged weapon with the following stats: 1L damage, -1 Initiative, Strength 1, Size 1.</li> <li>Linen armor with the following stats: 1/0 armor, Strength 2, Defense -1.</li> <li>A piece of equipment providing +2 dice to one Skill.</li> <li>Undefined supply of sacraments providing +1 Sacrament Yantras for 2 of your Arcana.</li> </ul><br /> You can buy/magic/steal more stuff during the game.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1050066#post1050066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok then I overspent on merits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still time to change them if you want!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T02:38:22-08:00","id":1050388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1050324#post1050324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aaand here we go! This is where I was planning to start off, but I decided to let you guys settle in first. I find that a good hook for Mage is throwing an impossible problem at the PCs and seeing how you solve it.<br /> <br /> Before I forget, here's how starting equipment will work, besides your Dedicated Tool. Everyone pick 2 of these:<ul><li>A melee or ranged weapon with the following stats: 1L damage, -1 Initiative, Strength 1, Size 1.</li> <li>Linen armor with the following stats: 1/0 armor, Strength 2, Defense -1.</li> <li>A piece of equipment providing +2 dice to one Skill.</li> <li>Undefined supply of sacraments providing +1 Sacrament Yantras for 2 of your Arcana.</li> </ul>You can buy/magic/steal more stuff during the game.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Still time to change them if you want!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Let me give it some thought, magic to get this stuff is fine but the real thing has its advantages.<br /> <br /> As for starting equipment I will take survival gear for the Red Lands and Undefined supply of sacraments providing +1 Sacrament for Death and Fate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-17-2017, 08:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T03:58:37-08:00","id":1050415,"title":"","content":"BTW: How do you want to handle Creative Thaunaturgy? Do you want us to post it here prior to trying to use it or just throw it into the IC thread and hope for the best?<br /> <br /> Below is how I handle it in my games.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">If you decide to cast a spell on the fly then the spell could backfire or just simply not work. There is a whole slew of things the could go wrong. This free form magic is up to my purview alone with no explanation as to how I came to that conclusion.<br /> <br /> If you want to develop a new spell then you should use the OOC thread to discuss it prior to needing it. That is less on the fly and represents a study into the workings of that spell, you have worked the kinks out.<br /> <br /> My view on Spells and Creative Thaumaturgy. This is where I will dissect the &quot;On the Fly&quot; spell and see if it works.<br /> <b>Arcanum:</b> Does this spell fall under the purview of the Arcanum used. <i>This is a simple succeed/fail.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Description:</b> The body of the text is everything, with the description you are setting the imago. I will try to determine the raw feel of the text and not look at intent. This is where the spell has the biggest chance of going wrong. <i>This is more likely to cause the spell to go haywire then to cause the spell to fail.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Practice:</b> This is used to shape the imago into the spell, adding the wrong practice to the description is the second biggest change of causing the spell to fail. <i>This is more of a succeed/fail than the spell going haywire.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Withstand:</b> If you didn't assign a withstand and I feel that it should have this then the spell could be less effective then you had hoped. <i>This is not a succeed/fail or a haywire thing, it just makes the spell less effective.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Rote Skills:</b> This does not apply as it isn't a rote. It could be learned as a rote later with study and perfecting the spell.<br /> <br /> <b>Reaches</b> If every thing else works out then the spell is cast. However if I feel that your intent is outside the effects of the spell I may add a reach to the spell and reroll the dice. This is where Paradox can slip in. Since this is going off your intent I will ask you what your intent for the spell was, if you haven't already stated it, and see if it matches the spell. <i>This is where your input matters as it judges your intent.</i></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-17-2017, 07:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T04:40:23-08:00","id":1050425,"title":"","content":"A melee weapon (namely, a sword) and a supply of sacraments for Mind and Spirit for me, thank you very much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T07:11:22-08:00","id":1050473,"title":"","content":"I'm guessing we're gonna dice rolls on here?<br /> <br /> Int+Survival+Tools = it's gonna be 6 dice total<br /> <br /> Also, as far as my stuff:<br /> Bow with 20 arrows (I can always make more)<br /> Linen armor<br /> Survival Tools (bonus to Survival)<br /> Sacraments for Prime and Matter<br /> <br /> I would also like to buy, with my Resources:<br /> Light leather armor (essentially greaves, bracers and a jerkin)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T07:45:32-08:00","id":1050492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Silver_Smoulder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1050473#post1050473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, as far as my stuff:<br /> Bow with 20 arrows (I can always make more)<br /> Linen armor<br /> Survival Tools (bonus to Survival)<br /> Sacraments for Prime and Matter</div> </div> </div> </div>We were to pick two, not that you couldn't buy the other two.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T09:58:57-08:00","id":1050558,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> Survival gear works a little differently. It gives you a +1 bonus to relevant rolls, and downgrades extreme environments by 1. You can also buy better gear that gives +2 and downgrades by 2, but it's Availability 3.<br /> <br /> Post mundane and magic rolls in the IC thread, preferably at the end of your post, and I'll narrate how the spell turned out. You can always ask about something in the OOC thread if you're making a custom spell or what have you. Try to format spells this way:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Quick description of what you're doing.<br /> Instant/Ritual, Touch/Aimed/Sensory, Standard/Advanced Duration, Standard/Advanced Scale, Standard/Advanced Potency, +X for other Reaches<br /> Reach: 1 free, 1 over<br /> Factors: Potency (primary) -X, Duration -Y, Scale -Z<br /> Yantras: whatever +1, something +2<br /> Nemesis: X from Reach, Y from other sources, -Z from Mana/Tool. Release/Contain. Nemesis roll. Wisdom roll.<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis+Arche+Yantras-Penalties. Casting roll.<br /> Aimed spell: Gnosis+Athletics/Archery-Defense-Penalties. Aimed spell roll.<br /> <br /> Like this!<br /> <br /> Casting Psychic Domination on the guard tower through my telescope, commanding them to jump off.<br /> Instant, Sensory, Standard Duration, Advanced Scale, Standard Potency, +2 dangerous command (1 Mana), +1 remote viewing, +1 exceeding spell control.<br /> Reach: 2 free, 5 over<br /> Factors: Potency 3 (Primary), Duration 3 turns (-4), Scale 5 subjects<br /> Yantras: High Speech +2, Dedicated Tool +1, Environment +1<br /> Nemesis: 10 from Reach, 2 from previous Nemesis rolls, -6 from Mana, -2 from Tool. Releasing: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/487145\" target=\"_blank\">2 Nemesis.</a><br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 3+Mind 3+Yantras 4-Factors 4-released Nemesis 2+Willpower 3. 7 dice, <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/487148\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes.</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I <b>strongly encourage</b> you to use Down and Dirty Spellcasting on Mage 117 to save time. If you're casting a spell that's well within your capabilities, the exact spell factors aren't that important, and failure wouldn't be interesting: just state your intent, roll Gnosis+Arche directly and move on. If you fail this roll, I'll probably give you a Condition or some Nemesis damage. You can do this to give [successes] bonus or penalty dice for [successes] number of specific actions on up to [successes] subjects, learn [successes] interesting facts about a subject, cause a more narrative effect, that kind of thing. Quick and easy!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12852_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12852\" data-vbnamecard=\"12852\">Silver_Smoulder</a> Post rolls in the IC thread. Use <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/c-To+The+Strongest\" target=\"_blank\">Orokos</a>!<br /> <br /> Survival gear works as I mentioned above, so just a +1 bonus for this roll. And as hardwire said, just pick 2 of the 4.<br /> <br /> Leather armor is 2/0, strength 2, defense -1, availability 1.<br /> <br /> I don't usually track individual arrows in RPGs, but let's try it this chapter and see if it's interesting or a pain. Just note how many you have left at the end of a post. &quot;Reloading&quot; is an instant action, but you can make it reflexive with a Ruling spell on yourself or the bow.<br /> <br /> Right now you have a basic hunting bow, size 3, range 30/60/120. You might be interested in the compound bow stats: [Strength] damage, range 40/80/160, size 4, availability 2.<br /> <br /> Talaus is no metallurgist, he just knows they make good iron blades, and lots of them. Meroitic tools and weapons are imported throughout Egypt, you could ask around and find one to examine yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 02-17-2017, 01:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T13:03:13-08:00","id":1050669,"title":"","content":"How much information was in that vision about the stars? Was it mostly allegory and such, or could I use the memory to establish not only the time but the place?<br /> <br /> You can determine latitude by seeing which stars are visible in the south,<br /> You can determine longitude if you know the stars and the time. For example, if X star is theta degrees above the horizon at midnight you know where you are east to west.<br /> <br /> For future reference, if I have an idea like that should I just try it IC and let you decide what the dice results mean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-17-2017, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T13:51:08-08:00","id":1050696,"title":"","content":"Okay, my bad. CAN we buy the other two? I mean, we all have Resources dots and a bit of them. Also, apparently I can magic tools out of thing air with Prime 3, so we really never have to worry about that, so huzzah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T13:55:36-08:00","id":1050699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Silver_Smoulder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1050696#post1050696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, my bad. CAN we buy the other two? I mean, we all have Resources dots and a bit of them. Also, apparently I can magic tools out of thing air with Prime 3, so we really never have to worry about that, so huzzah.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I can use Fate 3 to raise equipment bonuses over 5. I wonder if those stack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T13:58:20-08:00","id":1050702,"title":"","content":"The vision is mostly going to be useful for recognizing the right place when/if you see it, but you can try to see what you can divine from the memory.<br /> <br /> Be warned: longitude measurement isn't going to be developed for another century by Sleepers, and it's about as difficult in a trackless ever-shifting desert as it is on the ocean. There aren't maps of the area you're going, only relative navigational lore by nomads.<br /> <br /> And yeah, just do stuff IC and I'll figure it out!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T14:11:06-08:00","id":1050709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1050702#post1050702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The vision is mostly going to be useful for recognizing the right place when/if you see it, but you can try to see what you can divine from the memory.<br /> <br /> Be warned: longitude measurement isn't going to be developed for another century by Sleepers, and it's about as difficult in a trackless ever-shifting desert as it is on the ocean. There aren't maps of the area you're going, only relative navigational lore by nomads.<br /> <br /> And yeah, just do stuff IC and I'll figure it out!</div> </div> </div> </div>Come to think of it... if the Earth is flat or round hasn't been established yet and wont for a century.<br /> <br /> However, there is still latitude at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T15:08:58-08:00","id":1050743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1050558#post1050558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> Survival gear works a little differently. It gives you a +1 bonus to relevant rolls, and downgrades extreme environments by 1. You can also buy better gear that gives +2 and downgrades by 2, but it's Availability 3.</div> </div> </div> </div>ok then that is the equipment survival Gear that I will take. Now since I am buying the survival gear then I will take Crafting tools as my free one. Also below is the format template that I was going to put my spells is if that is OK by your.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Rote/Praxis/Improvised Imago:</b> Name: (Arcanum \u25cf): Desired Effect<br /> <b>Dice Pool:</b> 3 (Gnosis) + X (Arcane) +X (Yantras) +3 (Willpower) +X (+1 /extra casting time interval) = XX dice pool.<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> Free Reaches: X, Reaches used: X (1 to move to instant casting, 1 to change Primary Spell Factor to Potency/Duration, 1 to change spell to Advanced Potency, 1 to change spell to Advanced Duration, 1 to change Advanced Duration to Indefinite, 1 to change spell to Sensory, 1 to change spell to Advanced Scale, 1 for over max spell control, X for Spell specific.)<br /> <b>Yantras used:</b> (XXX), (XXX), (XXX)<br /> <b>Casting Time:</b> 1 Hour (Ritual)/2 Hours (Grimoire)/X Hours (Ritual or Grimoire +Extra time)/Instant (X turns).<br /> <i><span style=\"color:Green\">Turns = 1 +(Yantras used -1)</span></i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Nemesis:</b> X (over reaching), 2 (Inured to spell), X-1 (Chanced Nemesis X times), 1 (Witnessed by Sleepers), -2 (Dedicated Magic Tool), -X (Mana) = X Dice or 1 Chance Die<br /> <i><span style=\"color:Green\">Try to contain it if the roll is a success/Release Nemesis if the roll is successful.</span></i><br /> <br /> <b>Multiple Sleeper Witnesses:</b> N/A, A few (9-again quality), Large Group (8-Again quality), Crowd (Rote Quality)<br /> <br /> <b>Withstand Trait</b>: Trait, Advanced Potency (+2 to Withstand Dispellation)<br /> <br /> <b>Results:</b><br /> <b>Mana Cost:</b> X (X Reduce Nemesis dice, 1 Spell Requirements, 1 Improvised Spell)<br /> <b>Willpower Cost:</b> X<br /> <br /> <b>Ending Spell Factors:</b><br /> <b>Potency:</b> X (<i>Primary</i>)<br /> <b>Duration:</b> XXX (<i>Primary</i>)<br /> <b>Scale:</b> XXX<br /> <b>Range:</b> XXX<br /> <b>Casting Time:</b> XXX.<br /> <b>Desired Effect:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Example<br /> <br /> <b>Praxis Imago:</b> Decay (Death \u2022\u2022): Destroy armor<br /> <b>Dice Pool:</b> 3 (Gnosis) + 3 (Arcane) +1 (Yantras) = 7 dice pool.<br /> <b>Reaches:</b> Free Reaches: 1, Reaches used: 3 (1 to move to instant casting, 1 to change spell to Advanced Scale, 1 change spell to Sensory)<br /> <b>Yantras used:</b> (Dedicated Magic Tool: Mace, -2 paradox +1 tool)<br /> <b>Casting Time:</b> Instant (1 turns).<br /> <i><span style=\"color:Green\">Turns = 1 +(Yantras used -1)</span></i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Nemesis:</b> 4 (2 over reaching) -2 (Dedicated Magic Tool),-2 (Mana) = 1 Chance Die<br /> <i><span style=\"color:Green\">Try to contain it if the roll is a success.</span></i><br /> <br /> <b>Multiple Sleeper Witnesses:</b> N/A<br /> <br /> <b>Withstand Trait</b>: None<br /> <br /> <b>Results:</b> Successful (2 successes)<br /> <b>Mana Cost:</b> 2<br /> <b>Willpower Cost:</b> 0<br /> <br /> <b>Ending Spell Factors:</b><br /> <b>Potency:</b> 3 (<i>Primary</i>)<br /> <b>Duration:</b> 1 round<br /> <b>Scale:</b> 5 targets<br /> <b>Range:</b> Sensory<br /> <b>Casting Time:</b> 1 turn.<br /> <b>Desired Effect:</b> As he strikes one target it decays their armor, and chains to their friends as well.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-17-2017, 06:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T15:16:22-08:00","id":1050753,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12852_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12852\" data-vbnamecard=\"12852\">Silver_Smoulder</a> Yeah you can just buy those things from people here, they're Availability 2 or lower. No Sacraments though, getting a supply of those is more complicated. I'm just laying out what everyone started play with as a baseline. I'm trying to keep things focused for right now by presenting some specific problems (whenever someone makes that Int+Survival roll in the IC thread) that you'll want equipment for, whether mundane or magical.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> So, each discrete item has a single equipment bonus. Per the Spell Stacking rules, when two spells affect the same aspect of a subject (like its equipment bonus), only the one with higher Potency applies. The Prime object would still exist, but it would have a different equipment bonus for the Fate spell's Duration. So they don't stack exactly.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> That format works too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T18:11:16-08:00","id":1050828,"title":"","content":"Free conditions for everyone! Now go off and resolve them to get us beats. Per p. 134 boon granted conditions can give beats with an exceptional success.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T01:11:48-08:00","id":1050912,"title":"","content":"I'd like to support your roll <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12852_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12852\" data-vbnamecard=\"12852\">Silver_Smoulder</a> . Is rolling Int+Ride to support Int+Survival appropriate?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T02:00:44-08:00","id":1050917,"title":"","content":"Ok I was looking up gematria, since it is one of my Oblations and I found an online calculator. So I calculated the word Strife and that is numerically equal to Angel is Death and the word Christ. I also looked up his wife's name Kesmit, which I just through some letters together as her name, and Kesmit is numerically equal to God of Death. I just find that freaky coincidental since he worships the God of Death Anubis.<br /> <br /> Add the numerical value of Strife with the numerical value of Kesmit and it becomes numerically equal to the word Satanic Bloodlines, and Mathematical Model of God. I find this funny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-18-2017, 05:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T04:14:13-08:00","id":1050939,"title":"","content":"Where did you want us to list gear.<br /> <br /> Free Gear: Undefined supply of sacraments providing +1 Sacrament for Death and Fate. and Crafting tools the provide a +2 Bonus.<br /> <br /> Purchased Gear: Survival gear that provides a +2 bonus, a Javelin.<br /> <br /> I also have a question about Shadow Crafting (Death \u2022\u2022\u2022), Am I able to craft armor that is already donned, using his own shadow as the source of the shadow to harden? Will I need to make a craft check to craft armor?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-18-2017, 12:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T08:27:54-08:00","id":1051004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1050828#post1050828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Free conditions for everyone! Now go off and resolve them to get us beats. Per p. 134 boon granted conditions can give beats with an exceptional success.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have a question, Why the -6 dice to boost potency (Your potency is already 4), and -2 to duration it lasts a day correct? Did you accidently which Potency and duration?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Casting Exceptional Luck rote to give us all the Charmed, Informed, Inspired, and Steadfast conditions<br /> Instant, Sensory, Advanced Duration, Advanced Scale, Standard Potency<br /> Reach: 4 free, 0 over<br /> Factors: Potency (primary) -6, Duration -2, Scale -0<br /> Yantras: Order Skill +6, High Speech +2, Shadowname +2, Order Tool +1<br /> Nemesis: 0 from Reach, 0 from other sources, -0 from Mana/Tool.<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 5 + Arche 4 + Yantras 11 - Penalties 8 = 12. Casting roll.<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/487305\" target=\"_blank\">6 Successes</a> - Exceptional","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-18-2017, 11:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T08:35:56-08:00","id":1051008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1051004#post1051004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I have a question, Why the -6 dice to boost potency (Your potency is already 4), and -2 to duration it lasts a day correct? Did you accidently which Potency and duration?<br /> Also Using a Rote\u2019s mudra adds the user\u2019s rating in the Rote\u2019s encoded Skill to her dice pool up to +5<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Casting Exceptional Luck rote to give us all the Charmed, Informed, Inspired, and Steadfast conditions<br /> Instant, Sensory, Advanced Duration, Advanced Scale, Standard Potency<br /> Reach: 4 free, 0 over<br /> Factors: Potency (primary) -6, Duration -2, Scale -0<br /> Yantras: Order Skill +6, High Speech +2, Shadowname +2, Order Tool +1<br /> Nemesis: 0 from Reach, 0 from other sources, -0 from Mana/Tool.<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 5 + Arche 4 + Yantras 11 - Penalties 8 = 12. Casting roll.<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/487305\" target=\"_blank\">6 Successes</a> - Exceptional</div> </div> </div> </div>The Rote skill was at 5, but Caladrui has said that the one extra die from being an order skill breaks the cap of 5. Raising the skill with magic does not.<br /> <br /> The -2 to duration was to make it last a day.<br /> <br /> As for -6, a basic success grants 1 boon, so I added three more levels of success to get three more. I see nothing about having a base potency of 4, which sounds something like counting as Arcana 5 for rotes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T08:58:43-08:00","id":1051013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1051008#post1051008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Rote skill was at 5, but Caladrui has said that the one extra die from being an order skill breaks the cap of 5. Raising the skill with magic does not.<br /> <br /> The -2 to duration was to make it last a day.<br /> <br /> As for -6, a basic success grants 1 boon, so I added three more levels of success to get three more. I see nothing about having a base potency of 4, which sounds something like counting as Arcana 5 for rotes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes I checked the skills after I wrote the post, my bad sorry<br /> <br /> So it lasts a day, just verifying.<br /> <br /> All primary spell factors go up one step per dot in the Arcamum - 1 so the primary spell factor of this spell is Potency and you have 4 dotes in Fate so it is a 4 potency.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T09:05:57-08:00","id":1051015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1051013#post1051013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes I checked the skills after I wrote the post, my bad sorry<br /> <br /> So it lasts a day, just verifying.<br /> <br /> All primary spell factors go up one step per dot in the Arcamum - 1 so the primary spell factor of this spell is Potency and you have 4 dotes in Fate so it is a 4 potency.</div> </div> </div> </div>My eyes completely glazed over that section, thank you for pointing it out. I suppose Caladrui will have to arbitrate if that means we get even more conditions or if he wouldn't mind me moving the extras into duration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T09:15:12-08:00","id":1051019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1051015#post1051015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My eyes completely glazed over that section, thank you for pointing it out. I suppose Caladrui will have to arbitrate if that means we get even more conditions or if he wouldn't mind me moving the extras into duration.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> no prob, I just started playing the game in December so I forget all kinds of stuff, and it is easy to miss in the book. But seeing the numbers I thought that you accidently mixed them up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T09:38:54-08:00","id":1051027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table align=\"center\" class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 250px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><img src=\"http://i855.photobucket.com/albums/ab116/cdjensen99/Setau2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Strife: <span style=\"color:darkred\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1037811-2e-stone-scribes-legacy-update#post1037811\">Death Scribe</a> of Anpu - The Hand of Death - His Lords Warrior</span></b><br /> <b>Path:</b> Moros | <b>Darshanas:</b> Vajrastra | <b>Great Cult: </b> Weret-Hekau<br /> <b>Mage Sight:</b> Peripheral | <b>Spells:</b> Exceptional Luck<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Charmed, Informed, Inspired, and Steadfast<br /> <span style=\"color:darkred\"><b>Health: </b>OOOOOOOO</span> | <b>Willpower:</b> 6/6 | <b>Hekau:</b> 6/12 (3)<br /> <br /> <b>Gear:</b> Javelin, Survival Gear (+2), Mace (Dedicated Magic Tool),<br /> Death Sacraments, Fate Sacraments.</div></td> </tr> </table></div> <hr /><br /> <br /> <br /> This is just testing a post header to see if it look good","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 02-18-2017, 07:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T17:16:37-08:00","id":1051230,"title":"","content":"In addition to being numerologically equal to Angel is Death, Christ, and Satanic Bloodlines, <b>Strife </b>is also the last name of the character <b>Cloud Strife </b>(\u30af\u30e9\u30a6\u30c9\u30fb\u30b9\u30c8\u30e9\u30a4\u30d5) from the popular Playstation roleplaying game <u><b>Final Fantasy VII</b></u>. Food for thought!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> Int+Ride is fine yeah!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> You can list gear in the header for now, I might come up with something different later. Yes, Shadow Crafting can make stuff that's already on your body, and something as simple as armor doesn't need a Craft check. If you wanted to make something with a specific design, you might need to roll, but just a protective shell is easy.<br /> <br /> Hold off on buying stuff with Resources for right now, do that in the IC thread. Post what your PC is looking for at the market, from the traders, wherever, and I'll give you some specific items to choose from.<br /> <br /> Maybe don't put a picture in the header, it's easier for me to parse when it's just text.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> Primary factor means you get free adds to that factor equal to Arcana rating, being a rote doesn't affect that. I think it would be easiest for me to just leave your roll as is in terms of duration/potency, you've already got an exceptional success and a bunch of free Conditions for the group. Just keep it in mind when you next roll spellcasting.<br /> <br /> Don't worry about it for now, but in the future, when one of you grants a Fate boon I'll ask you to provide specific actions that your Conditions can apply to, in the same way that you only grant a dice bonus or 8-again to specific Skills/actions. I also might houserule the Conditions that Fate can grant: the guaranteed success of Informed and Steadfast is a huge benefit that I'd like to be more rare and specific.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 02-18-2017, 08:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T18:21:38-08:00","id":1051262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1051230#post1051230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In addition to being numerologically equal to Angel is Death, Christ, and Satanic Bloodlines, <b>Strife </b>is also the last name of the character <b>Cloud Strife </b>(\u30af\u30e9\u30a6\u30c9\u30fb\u30b9\u30c8\u30e9\u30a4\u30d5) from the popular Playstation roleplaying game <u><b>Final Fantasy VII</b></u>. Food for thought!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> You can list gear in the header for now, I might come up with something different later. Yes, Shadow Crafting can make stuff that's already on your body, and something as simple as armor doesn't need a Craft check. If you wanted to make something with a specific design, you might need to roll, but just a protective shell is easy.<br /> <br /> Hold off on buying stuff with Resources for right now, do that in the IC thread. Post what your PC is looking for at the market, from the traders, wherever, and I'll give you some specific items to choose from.<br /> <br /> Maybe don't put a picture in the header, it's easier for me to parse when it's just text.</div> </div> </div> </div>Since I have never played any of the Final Fantasy games I have no Idea what significance that is sorry if the reference is wasted on me.<br /> <br /> I will hold off on the gear until I have perused the market place. I have added only the Gear that I have at the start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-19T04:44:05-08:00","id":1051464,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#40D080\">Imhotep</span>, scribe-physician of Anubis</b><br /> <b>Sorcerous Sight:</b> Peripheral | <b>Conditions:</b> Charmed, Informed, Inspired, Steadfast | <b>Spells:</b> none<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>Willpower:</b> 6/6 | <b>Hekau:</b> 6/11 (2)<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">Urbi</span>, emissary of Anubis (???)</b><br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Familiar, Resonant, Open, Fettered<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> OOOOOO | <b>Health:</b> OOOOOO | <b>Willpower:</b> 8/8 | <b>Essence:</b> 7/15</div> <br /> Just headers.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2207\" data-vbnamecard=\"2207\">Caladriu</a>, Imhotep and Strife (possibly Unbound, too) entered Legacies through tutoring, which gives 1 A-beat. Imhotep also internalised a Praxis, which gives 1 AXP and 1 A-beat. Does the A-beat pot start with 3, 4, 8 or 9 A-beats?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpat