haggle the price down to help with the purchases,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T07:54:16-08:00","id":1056635,"title":"","content":"You could temporary boost your Resources to 4 and (maybe) bulk buy/hire.<br /> <br /> You could buy survival gear and wax, I could boost my Resources to 3 and hire Asyut. Then if ST allows, go for broke, boost Resources again to 2, and buy bandages and salves.<br /> <br /> I'm assuming my crit counted as haggle (unintentionally).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T08:56:29-08:00","id":1056652,"title":"","content":"I can give myself Resources 4 as well. Of course it will evaporate into promises and dreams when we leave, but that's life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T09:05:19-08:00","id":1056656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1056652#post1056652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can give myself Resources 4 as well. Of course it will evaporate into promises and dreams when we leave, but that's life.</div> </div> </div> </div>Making it last at least a month would be a good idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T18:43:19-08:00","id":1056922,"title":"","content":"Actually, if we pay a guide with &quot;fairy gold&quot; and let the spell expire while we are out in the desert, how would he even know? Or would it be that we traded the fairy gold for real money in town and used that to pay him and it is the merchants we left behind who discover they have been cheated?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T20:05:38-08:00","id":1056953,"title":"","content":"When you use Fate to get Resources, the idea is that money temporarily comes your way. A merchant's cart tips over, or you find valuable coins left behind in the room, or you get too much change from a transaction. In a backwater town like this where there just isn't that much money unaccounted for, it's especially difficult to plausibly (read: non-Dissonance) get access to say, Resources 3 or more.<br /> <br /> When Shifting the Odds expires, your temporary Allies/Contacts move on and stop being so friendly with you, and might have questions about what happened. Similarly, I assume Resources expiring means that your temporary money is lost by accident or chance as easily as it was found.<br /> <br /> My attitude as ST is that the abstract dramatic rules of the Resources mechanic are more important than the in-character specifics of where the money is going, unless I see an opportunity for an interesting situation. In a small and relatively tight-knit area like this, someone is going to notice when the money stops being Fatebound to you, regardless of the specifics of who has which coins. With a longer Duration, the money will get further away before anyone notices.<br /> <br /> What would probably happen is that the coins you gave him would be stolen or lost in the same way that the money came into your possession.<br /> <br /> Which isn't to say that you can't do it. If you guys feel like cheating the guy who's helping you survive in the desert, go for it, it's just that Sleepers will notice and make your lives harder when (if?) you come back to town.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> yeah your crit counted as a haggle, he was 4 in my notes and you've dropped his price to 3. I posted a shopping list for you guys which you can reference. Everything still on the list is &quot;priced as marked&quot; though, haggling won't reduce the cost. You can magic or steal it if you want to get your hands dirty.<br /> <br /> If by boost your Resources you mean making a purchase at +1 dot and then dropping it for a month, that's just once per chapter. I'll say this: you can raise Resources that way and have your one purchase be &quot;a specific number of items that would be free at the higher rating,&quot; although you can't do that and also make a single costed purchase, if that makes sense. All the Availability 2 items you want OR one Availability 3 item.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T01:18:42-08:00","id":1057021,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1049458-ic-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1052246#post1052246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Locating the Hand of U'mat will be an extended Stamina+Survival roll, one roll per day. You don't know the target number. The primary actor, which will be one of the PCs, can make a number of rolls equal to their Stamina+Survival rating, while the dicepool itself is modified with bonuses and penalties. Other PCs can contribute as secondary actors with Wits+Survival or Manipulation+Ride, scouting ahead or preparing food and shelter or guarding against weather conditions.<br /> <br /> At the bare minimum, you will need to rent some camels and bring enough water and rations for a prolonged trip. (no bonus, Availability 2)<br /> Instead, you could ask the desert nomads for their better-trained camels. (+2 bonus to primary actor and supporting Ride rolls, Availability 3)<br /> It would be wise to find a skilled guide who knows the desert. (Allows up to 2 additional rolls, but must find and convince someone. Availability ?)<br /> <br /> The Red Land is an Extreme Environment, but its level varies over time. It's always at least Level 1 from heat or cold, and it can reach Level 2 on hot days or cold nights. On dangerous days (not nights), it can reach Level 3 from heat and wind. If you're caught in a sandstorm (Set forbid), it's Level 4, and mundane Survival gear won't protect you. Extreme Environments are explained on Mage 224. Much, but not all of this can be mitigated with Forces.<br /> <br /> Basic Survival gear (protective clothing and canvas tents) gives a +1 bonus to Survival rolls and downgrades the Environment level by 1. (Availability 1 to outfit the group)<br /> Instead, Advanced Survival gear (desert nomad clothing, tents, and advice) gives a +2 bonus to Survival rolls and downgrades the Environment level by 2. (Availability 3 to outfit the group)<br /> <br /> You can choose to travel by day or by night. The weather is more extreme by day, but it's dark and there are more potential predators by night. Minor bites and stings can be deadly serious in the wasteland.<br /> <br /> If you're planning to travel by night, or just want an easy source of fire, you could buy torches and fuel. (Counters 2 dice of Poor Light penalties, Availability 1)<br /> The body's natural healing is more difficult in the desert, but if you bring bandages and salves, you can treat injury. (Enables Medicine rolls, Availability 2)</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049880#post1049880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's going to be relevant soon, so here's the Resources/Availability rules. Once per chapter, you can expend the Resources merit to purchase an item or service with Availability equal to your Resources dots or dots-1. You can instead buy something of your Resources+1, but you have to reduce your Resources dots by 1 for the rest of the month. If something costs at least 2 dots less than your Resources, you can buy it without expending Resources for the chapter.<br /> <br /> For example, if you have Resources 3, you can buy as many Availability 1 items as you want, or you can expend the Merit for the chapter to buy one thing of Availability 2 or 3. Or you can buy something of Availability 4, and then have Resources 2 for the rest of the month.<br /> <br /> Instead of using Resources, if you have an appropriate Skill at a rating equal to or greater than Availability, you can procure the item with a single roll of Attribute+Skill-Availability. What counts as an appropriate skill depends on the context and how exactly you plan to get the item or service, but Larceny and Streetwise are usually good bets. You might also be able to convince someone to help with your relevant Animal Ken knowledge, or secure a precious item as a gift after formally Socializing with the owner.</div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> Ok so if I am understanding correctly, I can purchase the Advanced Survival Gear at a resources 3 and that would expend my resources for the Chapter. By <i>expend</i> do you mean that I have no resources to purchase anything else for the chapter? If I wanted to purchase a resources 3 and a resources 2 combined would that be a resources 5 or 4, since resources is somewhat an exponential growth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T09:15:49-08:00","id":1057122,"title":"","content":"You can either purchase one Resources 2 or one Resources 3 item. You could also temporarily raise Resources to 4 for one purchase, and that one purchase could be one 3/4 item OR as many 1/2 items as you like.<br /> <br /> Yeah, expending means no more Resources this chapter.<br /> <br /> The intent is that you may not be able to buy everything and you'll have to make some choices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T11:52:17-08:00","id":1057174,"title":"","content":"If I temporary raise resources to 3, could I later purchase bandages haggled down to 1?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T12:00:55-08:00","id":1057178,"title":"","content":"Haggling is no longer a thing, unless you have a merit like Fixer. Availability is what it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T02:56:26-08:00","id":1057506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1049880#post1049880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Instead of using Resources, if you have an appropriate Skill at a rating equal to or greater than Availability, you can procure the item with a single roll of Attribute+Skill-Availability. What counts as an appropriate skill depends on the context and how exactly you plan to get the item or service, but Larceny and Streetwise are usually good bets. You might also be able to convince someone to help with your relevant Animal Ken knowledge, or secure a precious item as a gift after formally Socializing with the owner.</div> </div> </div> </div>If haggling is out does that mean that this option is no longer available?<br /> <br /> I will get the survival gear for the group but that would deplete my resources, If we can still use the above method I can temporarily boost my medicine and get the bandages and the salves.<br /> <br /> That leaves the torches and the Camels for someone else to get.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T11:29:03-08:00","id":1057675,"title":"","content":"I thought expert gear and camels were in a Av 3 pack together?<br /> <br /> Any way, my current plan is (assuming the above is true): Strife buys gear and camels, Imhotep goes for broke and hires Asyut, then asks Khvarenah for fairy silver or uses skills to impress bandage/salve vendor. I'm still debatting offering blood to hire vamp guard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T11:46:45-08:00","id":1057683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1057506#post1057506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If haggling is out does that mean that this option is no longer available?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, you can still procure stuff with a Skill roll! You just can't reduce Availability with one roll and then buy it with less Resources. You can absolutely raise Medicine (or have Imhotep do it himself) and convince the Temple staff (closest thing to healers around here) that you need some. I'm pretty sure you'd need Unbound to help out with Mind 3 Enhance Skill unless you had something else in mind- you need to raise your Skill rating itself, not just grant a temporary dice bonus. Incidentally, you can also improve your chances on the extended roll by Enhance Skill-ing the Survival/Ride ratings of PCs who already have at least 1 dot.<br /> <br /> Basic camels are Av 2. Better camels are Av 3. Expert gear is a separate Av 3 purchase.<br /> <br /> You should probably talk to the vamp yourself if you want to know their prices and services. Maybe you can get the blood tithe pro-rated. Or maybe a mage can offer something more interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-04T04:18:10-08:00","id":1057992,"title":"","content":"I have been sick the last few day and now that I am feeling better I will get an IC post up today.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-06T01:59:58-08:00","id":1058830,"title":"","content":"Strife would invite Unbound to the temple with him but he is not sure how well he will be receive showing up with yet another stranger and of a different culture. I will make the roll to aquire the medical supplies and add it to my post later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T10:49:56-08:00","id":1060173,"title":"","content":"Composing replies isn't easy for me to begin with, and I'm gettiing hit hard by depression lately.<br /> <br /> I was going to post that Imhotep asks Unbound to boost his Man, Ride and Socialise so he has a better chance to talk someone into lending them trained camels, and go to the camp looking for these camels. I'm not sure if this is appropriate now that it would detract Unbound's and Strife's time and spell control.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T11:54:21-08:00","id":1060203,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> Thanks for sticking with us, I like having Imhotep (and Urbi) in the game!<br /> <br /> You can get the better camels &quot;on credit&quot; with a Manipulation+Ride-3 roll as long as you have at least Ride 3, no Socialize necessary. Short simple posts like that are more than welcome. Down and Dirty spellcasting would be appropriate here since Unbound would just be boosting a simple roll.<br /> <br /> I think technically you need a relevant Social merit of the appropriate level as an additional qualification to &quot;buy&quot; something with a Skill roll like this, but I'll handwave that for the medicine and camels. You can invoke your Patron's name in those specific cases to persuade people you're a big deal and good things will happen if they help you.<br /> <br /> Do you want to look into this Shadow situation tonight, or no? If you do, I'll move you right to the action.<br /> <br /> To-do list before you guys leave town, anyone can do these:<ul><li>Get camels (Resources 3 or Manipulation+Ride-3)</li> <li>Get advanced survival gear (Resources 3 expenditure, no roll)</li> <li>Hire Asyut (also Resources 3, no roll)</li> <li>Buy some torches and fire fuel (Resources 1)</li> <li>Negotiate with the Shadow about guarding the caravan, maybe (???)</li> <li>Study Khvarenah's hollow Fate (try Revelation at Opacity 4 with different Arcana until something sticks?)</li> </ul><br /> All of those are really optional, all you <i>need </i>is some camels.<br /> <br /> <b>Actually, now that I think of it: </b>is there anything on that list you guys <i>don't </i>want to buy? I feel like moving things along, I don't mind just saying &quot;you bought the stuff and now you're out of Resources for the chapter.&quot; The only thing I really want to do onscreen is the Shadows, if someone (Imhotep? Strife? Unbound? Khvarenah? Some combo/all of the above?) wants to skulk around the Temple tonight to find them. After that y'all can hit the trail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T13:57:10-08:00","id":1060267,"title":"","content":"I'd like to investigate the Shadows for a bit before we actually talk to them. To that end, I'd go to the temple at sunrise (going into the lion's den at night knowing nothing of what's in there is not very smart, especially when you investigate a group called The Shadows) cloaked in Incognito Presence to look for any relevant information and possibly the lair itself.<br /> <br /> If the group is okay with that, then that's what I'd do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T14:54:18-08:00","id":1060294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1060203#post1060203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> <br /> <br /> To-do list before you guys leave town, anyone can do these:<ul><li>Get camels (Resources 3 or Manipulation+Ride-3)</li> <li>Get advanced survival gear (Resources 3 expenditure, no roll)</li> <li>Hire Asyut (also Resources 3, no roll)</li> <li>Buy some torches and fire fuel (Resources 1)</li> <li>Negotiate with the Shadow about guarding the caravan, maybe (???)</li> <li>Study Khvarenah's hollow Fate (try Revelation at Opacity 4 with different Arcana until something sticks?)</li> </ul><br /> All of those are really optional, all you <i>need </i>is some camels.<br /> <br /> <b>Actually, now that I think of it: </b>is there anything on that list you guys <i>don't </i>want to buy? I feel like moving things along, I don't mind just saying &quot;you bought the stuff and now you're out of Resources for the chapter.&quot; The only thing I really want to do onscreen is the Shadows, if someone (Imhotep? Strife? Unbound? Khvarenah? Some combo/all of the above?) wants to skulk around the Temple tonight to find them. After that y'all can hit the trail.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am fine with getting everything on the list and counting our resources as zero for the Chapter, I will be helping Khvarenah investigate his hollow Fate issue, and then when Unbound is ready to go deal with the shadows then I will go with.<br /> <br /> I will put this in a post but I will pledge that if I see one I will do my best to capture it alive and return it to the Temple, Nothing short of protecting his wife will make him try to kill it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T17:50:13-08:00","id":1060352,"title":"","content":"Alright, so there's talk of going to the temple under Incognito Presence at sunrise on Day 3. We can run with that unless someone has a different idea.<br /> <br /> Anyone who wants to investigate the hollow fate: you're using Focused Mage Sight to do Revelation (p. 92) on an Opacity 4 Mystery, which can be seen in Khvarenah's Nimbus. You can't Scrutinize yet. Try whichever Arche you like, just remember that adding non-Ruling ones to Mage Sight requires 1 Mana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T18:08:53-08:00","id":1060357,"title":"","content":"Ok so no lowering the Opaciy with scrutinizing but we can make a revelation roll with the Focused Mage sight, correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T19:35:56-08:00","id":1060387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1060203#post1060203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><ul><li>Study Khvarenah's hollow Fate (try Revelation at Opacity 4 with different Arcana until something sticks?)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>I quite like what you did with that. Its an incentive not to throw out super maximized fate rolls IC without forbidding it OOC. Can I try Scrutinizing it with my arcana, or do I already know all I can get?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T20:43:07-08:00","id":1060406,"title":"","content":"I was hoping you'd be into it! This is me riffing on Planescape Torment and KOTOR II and Mask of the Betrayer and other Obsidian games featuring a weird metaphysical curse. Maybe if you study it more, it could have unexpected boons as well...<br /> <br /> No lowering the Opacity, but Revelation is okay. You'll find out more once you learn the Surface Information, but investigating this Mystery is going to be a little more complex and drawn out while using the same systems. Khvarenah can still try Revealing with Space or Time if it seems relevant.<br /> <br /> Anyone who wants to try gets 1 roll for now: if you fail the Revelation, you fail and you'll have to try another approach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-11T17:25:54-08:00","id":1061388,"title":"","content":"Fast-forwarded because I'm getting antsy and wanted to be further along by now. Anyone who wants to be in the temple library is there, under the effects of a single Incognito Presence spell. Any additional spellcasting will have to be done during this current scene, the pre-dawn hours weren't mystically ideal for prep work.<br /> <br /> The group is assumed to have used up their Resources and bought the equipment I statted out already, including the advanced camels and survival gear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T03:52:23-07:00","id":1061498,"title":"","content":"My appologies I will try to be quicker with my posting so that the game can move along.<br /> <br /> I was unsuccessful in finding the door the first time around. After the others try I will give it another go.<br /> <br /> I do not lose my 1 lethal damage until sundown correct, If I remember correctly it was just after entering the temple on the first day so that I could study the Dark Stain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T07:38:26-07:00","id":1061817,"title":"","content":"Can one of Death shadow spells push the shadows into the corners?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","us