motely useful Potency, so I'd probably need a Superlative Luck from Khvarenah for this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T13:17:40-07:00","id":1063423,"title":"","content":"You could also make a different suggestion for something of similar value, he's just laying out terms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T13:36:25-07:00","id":1063446,"title":"","content":"I was mostly fishing for a way to get closer to the master. For all he knows, it is the thing that is looking at him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T15:09:09-07:00","id":1063554,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> With Momentary Flux you pose a suggestion as a player, like &quot;Would Perfect Sympathy be a suitable spell,&quot; and you'll learn if it would be a good or bad option. You still need to come up with a possibility yourself, at least until you get Time 4 and Prophecy is on the table.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T15:13:51-07:00","id":1063560,"title":"","content":"Does &quot;Would offering some of the Time spells I can cast be likely to be accepted in place of maintaining one&quot; work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-16-2017, 06:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T15:33:00-07:00","id":1063581,"title":"","content":"Yeah that's fine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a> Imhotep, being a Weret-Hekau and educated Egyptian, can roll Intelligence+Academics to get some info about that <i>henet </i>the Shadow mentioned. Or any other mythic stuff that eluded you.<br /> <br /> Also good use of Greek roots by Unbound, haha","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T15:34:50-07:00","id":1063585,"title":"","content":"Okay, so I've set up a telepathic link to be able to post this: what is our negotiation strategy, actually? Do we agree to the terms? I mean. the blessings notwithstanding, the sheer blood expenditure would mean that worst-case scenario at least some of us are 4 lethal damage down. That's before whatever we will find in the ruins and before the way back to the town. Given the limited supply of healing equipment I was thinking we either suggest they drink from someone else (like camels or people hired specifically for this purpose) or agree to the Permanent spell condition. <br /> <br /> There is also the question: is lying allowed? We could probably try to cross them (it's probable they won't try to pursue us far from their haven) or make them enter an unfavorable contract. Also, we could gain something from using Withstood Mind magic, but there is always a chance that this will fail, they'll take offense and the deal will be effectively off the table.<br /> <br /> What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T15:37:14-07:00","id":1063587,"title":"","content":"Lying is allowed. You can enter into a contract in bad faith- this isn't a Fate oath, as far as you know, and it might be wise not to advertise that you can magically bind promises. It would be safer if you knew whether the Shadows have supernatural or mundane means of detecting lies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T15:50:45-07:00","id":1063596,"title":"","content":"I was more about to ask the group if we potentially accept lies/Mind control as a legitimate negotiation strategy, but thanks for the advice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T16:47:43-07:00","id":1063646,"title":"","content":"Worst case scenario, we are really good at skipping town. I can burn all the sympathetic bridges behind us and colocate to teleport away. Like to Greece or Persia.<br /> <br /> Now, as for acting in bad faith: Khvarenha is opposed to lying for religious reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T17:06:43-07:00","id":1063659,"title":"","content":"There is our bargaining tool Fate can lift curses, especially fate 4. If you could see the master and look at his fate you might be able to talk intelligently of the curse and tell him that you could try to life it but then it would cost them and flip the tables.<br /> <br /> Fate could also try and force them into doing stuff for us, but that is a tricky thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T17:45:42-07:00","id":1063677,"title":"","content":"This is either an old vampire or a mummy. Walking in, essentially naked, means we should not try anything right now.<br /> <br /> However, we don't actually need them. We need something with a sympathetic link OR enough of a description that we could find things. Once we have those we can either co-locate there directly, or go out into the desert where there are no witnesses and use magic to move really fast or teleport in steps toward it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T18:19:26-07:00","id":1063692,"title":"","content":"Keep in mind that you don't know where the Hand <i>is.</i> Everyone you've asked so far has never heard of it. There are ways around that, but all you've got right now is &quot;it's to the south somewhere in a massive expanse of uncharted desert.&quot; It's needle in a million haystacks territory without some kind of guide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T19:30:31-07:00","id":1063718,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> forgot to mention, roll Manipulation+Empathy-2 if you want him to open up about what he's lost. You can edit it into your last post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-17T13:45:52-07:00","id":1064014,"title":"","content":"Just to avoid long strings of one line of dialog in the IC:<br /> <br /> I am going to offer to use some of my Time 1 powers to do things like look into the past of the vamp or the mummy and based on that perhaps some Space to find particular objects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-19T04:51:03-07:00","id":1064708,"title":"","content":"Is there anything I can do to help move this along?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-19T20:39:01-07:00","id":1065077,"title":"","content":"Strife can hop down into the tunnel as well if you like, I don't want to leave you hanging. I assume he's heard what's being said out loud. And because of how Unbound cast his spell, Strife will be able to join the telepathy if he stands inside the circle of herbs, which he could very well do by accident.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T03:08:22-07:00","id":1065157,"title":"","content":"I hope that you do not mid me getting creative with my spells and coming up with new uses for the spell. I figure that a durability 2 Skin tight case of hardend shadows could hold a very strong being as they do not have room to push their strength. If you rule that the use of Shadow Crafting as an attack spell with give it a withstand then I will use the Charmed Condition on me to turn the successes into exceptional success and bypass withstand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T13:15:53-07:00","id":1065383,"title":"","content":"Hmm, okay, I was kind of expecting you would make a counteroffer or something, not attack the dude the other PCs were negotiating with. I'll reply later today once I'm free.<br /> <br /> Also reminder that Khvarenah had Time Sight up, which lets him react to things a second before they happen. He can jump in with a reflexive action or other quick response if he likes.<br /> <br /> Also, roll a Clash of Wills for Shadow Crafting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 03-20-2017, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T14:11:54-07:00","id":1065422,"title":"","content":"My spell was countered, but that was my Han Solo in carbonite spell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T15:14:41-07:00","id":1065447,"title":"","content":"If I threw up a space ban in place to seal off the area, would that have prevented Strife's magic since he wouldn't have any sort of line of sight or effect and wouldn't know what was going on inside?<br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\">Edit: </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a><div align=\"center\"> I think you have a mistaken idea about what is going on.<br /> <br /> The priests in the main temple are performing their usual nightly ritual. That is the source of the chanting.<br /> <br /> The secret room only as the sleeping mummy and the embraced as a child vampire with whom we are negotiating. The room is under the main sanctuary.</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-20-2017, 06:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T15:33:07-07:00","id":1065457,"title":"","content":"Yeah Exthalion has it (broadly) right, I'm sorry if I've been describing the situation poorly.<br /> <br /> There'd be time to cast Ban or another action between the darkvision spell and the shadowcrafting spell. The threat that you have someone who can and will control shadows could give you leverage. Or if anyone wants to amend their action, that's an option too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T16:40:11-07:00","id":1065486,"title":"","content":"As I understand the situation the priest are finishing their morning rituals and this is the morning of the third day and that when they are finished then they will be about their morning business such as their studies which include going into the study room that we are currently in. The tunnel is where we are currently, to my understanding, and that we haven't entered the room under the temple yet. the Vampire stands in our way.<br /> <br /> So we are on a time table.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1049458-ic-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1061386#post1061386\">Read this post again</a><br /> <br /> The way I see it is if we capture the Vampire(s), which the hardened shadows had a real chance of doing and then we force him/them to do what we need them to do. To bargain with them to give them blood is ridiculous. Someone will be taking 2L wounds a day just to live up to this bargain. Or we give them some other boon. Now forcing someone to do our bidding isn't the best answer but to sit here and bargain with our blood isn't the way either. If I am reading the post that I copied correctly we have a limited time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 03-20-2017, 07:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T17:10:04-07:00","id":1065503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1065486#post1065486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I understand the situation the priest are finishing their morning rituals and this is the morning of the third day and that when they are finished then they will be about their morning business such as their studies which include going into the study room that we are currently in. The tunnel is where we are currently, to my understanding, and that we haven't entered the room under the temple yet. the Vampire stands in our way.<br /> <br /> So we are on a time table.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1049458-ic-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1061386#post1061386\">Read this post again</a><br /> <br /> The way I see it is if we capture the Vampire(s), which the hardened shadows had a real chance of doing and then we force him/them to do what we need them to do. To bargain with them to give them blood is ridiculous. Someone will be taking 2L wounds a day just to live up to this bargain. Or we give them some other boon. Now forcing someone to do our bidding isn't the best answer but to sit here and bargain with our blood isn't the way either. If I am reading the post that I copied correctly we have a limited time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can colocate. We can just walk back into the room we are renting from here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T17:18:16-07:00","id":1065507,"title":"","content":"That is if we do not stand around all day giving away our blood. The point is that we do not have alot of time.<br /> <br /> We need to move this along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-20T23:25:15-07:00","id":1065604,"title":"","content":"TIme 1: Divination<br /> 1 Reach Specific Questions<br /> &quot;Travel in which direction to the limits of my ability to colocate will take me closest to the hand?&quot;<br /> <br /> Space 3: Colocate<br /> <br /> Repeat as needed.<br /> <br /> <br /> This negotiation is to get a better fix on the location because that is expensive and time-consuming since every Colocate costs a mana and I only have Time 1 so have to ritual cast Divination to avoid Paradox.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: We can continue without me doing magic in the IC. I got 0 successes on the spell casting roll once I remembered that a dedicated tool counts against the reflexive yantra.<br /> <br /> Khaverna is still mad about risking Nemesis though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-21-2017, 02:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T01:33:16-07:00","id":1065632,"title":"","content":"Not to mention that you would need to effect a minimum of 6 people, 1 wolf, 6 camels and all of the gear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T22:56:19-07:00","id":1066130,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the delay y'all. If someone wants to offer the alternative terms discussed, go for it. You can also just kill and loot some vampires if you want, although they do have the homefield advantage. I encourage you to check in this thread before doing anything rash.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar10396_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"10396\" data-vbnamecard=\"10396\">Woland</a> BTW, you guys do have torches with you because you bought some at the market as part of the supply run. If we go into initiative time, lighting one takes an action.<br /> <br /> Oh yeah: if you guys go the Colocation desert-jumping route, you may want to decide what you're gonna do about Asyut and whether you want to bring him at all. Non-Mages tend to get antsy when you teleport them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 03-22-2017, 02:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T02:27:05-07:00","id":1066194,"title":"","content":"I succeeded in the the Wits+Crafts roll to know the significance of the room layout. Also would you allow this spell using using Creative Thaumaturgy. If we are going to do magic in the desert then I think we should at least prepare the sleepers to witness magic safely. It is a death version of the prime Stealing Fire.<br /> <br /> I do not see the link when you say this thread.<br /> <br /> <b>Splice Soul (Death \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf)</b><br /> <b>Practice:</b> Weaving<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Duration<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Resolve<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Intimidate, Medicine, Occult.<br /> For the duration of this spell the mage can splice a sliver of his soul onto that of a Living soul. The target must be a sleeper and for the duration of this spell he temporarily becomes a sleepwalker with all that entails. Any breaking points due to witnessing magic and Quiescence effects the subject would normally suffer are held in abeyance until the spell\u2019s Duration expires, only to come crashing down all at once when the spell ends.<br /> <b>+1 Reach:</b> As long as the spell\u2019s Duration lasts, its wielder may spend one point of Mana at any time to \u201crecharge\u201d this effect, and the sleeper remains a sleepwalker.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T23:38:11-07:00","id":1066719,"title":"","content":"I keep wanting to highlight important words in my posts, Legend of Zelda style. <i>When you enter a <span style=\"color:#FF8C00\">hidden chamber</span>, your controller will vibrate.</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1066194#post1066194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Splice Soul (Death \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf)</b><br /> <b>Practice:</b> Weaving<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Duration<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Resolve<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Intimidate, Medicine, Occult.<br /> For the duration of this spell the mage can splice a sliver of his soul onto that of a Living soul. The target must be a sleeper and for the duration of this spell he temporarily becomes a sleepwalker with all that entails. Any breaking points due to witnessing magic and Quiescence effects the subject would normally suffer are held in abeyance until the spell\u2019s Duration expires, only to come crashing down all at once when the spell ends.<br /> <b>+1 Reach:</b> As long as the spell\u2019s Duration lasts, its wielder may spend one point of Mana at any time to \u201crecharge\u201d this effect, and the sleeper remains a sleepwalker.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, granting people magic stuff is under Prime for a reason. However, with his Occult (Five-Part Soul) specialty, Strife knows that some Weret-Hekau have experimented with removing a Sleepwalker's soul and grafting it onto a Sleeper whose soul has also been removed. That's something a Death mage could try, assuming you could find a Sleepwalker and didn't care about your Wisdom too much.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T02:37:53-07:00","id":1066753,"title":"","content":"Wisdom who needs it anyway, but noted. So something of a soul swap spell,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T09:53:45-07:00","id":1066961,"title":"","content":"Who were you saying never do that again to and referring to what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T10:30:40-07:00","id":1066997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1066961#post1066961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who were you saying never do that again to and referring to what?</div> </div> </div> </div>Strife, saying to never go half cocked into the middle of a negotiation again. Just because he is frustrated does not mean he can flip the table and hold people at spearpoint. That isn't how negotiation works and it shows tremendous disrespect to the rest of the &quot;party&quot; who are not expecting it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-23-2017, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T10:47:43-07:00","id":1067009,"title":"","content":"AND you don't tell me how to play my character. I don't care who you think you are. You can ask me to be less hasty but you don't demand it. I do not have my sheet in front of me as I am at work, but I do believe that my vice it hasty, I put that for on of my characters and can't look it up. <br /> <br /> But you don't command me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T10:54:33-07:00","id":1067012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1067009#post1067009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">AND you don't tell me how to play my character. I don't care who you think you are. You can ask me to be less hasty but you don't demand it. I do not have my sheet in front of me as I am at work, but I do believe that my vice it hasty, I put that for on of my characters and can't look it up.<br /> <br /> But you don't command me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't. My character told your character something and then at your request I explained what he meant (as well as editing the IC post since the context wasn't clear and that was my fault)<br /> <br /> Party was in quotes because a bunch of sorcerers traveling around wouldn't call themselves that but the term is familiar from RPGs. Strife disrespected the other characters and made their job harder with that little stunt. <br /> <br /> Just because something is explained OOC does not mean it is directed at players. You are free to play your character as you like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T10:59:48-07:00","id":1067016,"title":"","content":"My bad, my character will respond in game. My apologies for jumping the gun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T11:01:31-07:00","id":1067018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1067016#post1067016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My bad, my character will respond in game. My apologies for jumping the gun.</div> </div> </div> </div>And my apologies for not being clear with what I meant IC or OOC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T20:32:59-07:00","id":1067356,"title":"","content":"Couple of rules reminders so everyone knows the stakes:<br /> <br /> Regardless of the method you use, searching the Red Land for your destination [as opposed to colocating there directly, which you have no way of doing right now] will be an extended Stamina+Survival roll with various penalties and bonuses and a currently unknown target number.<br /> <br /> The mechanical effect of bringing Asyut along, which is optional, is to allow the primary actor 2 additional rolls on top of their Stamina+Survival rating.<br /> <br /> The mechanical effect of bringing a Shadow along, also optional, is to give you a 3-dot Retainer (6 dice) which can assist the above roll, help out in combat, and other actions.<br /> <br /> Also, about Sympathy: targeting something sympathetically requires a Sympathetic Connection <b><i>and </i></b>a Sympathy Yantra. Space 2 &quot;Borrow Threads&quot; is a good way to get connections if you know someone who has them naturally, but Yantras can be a little harder as you need a piece of the target, or at least a good physical representation of them or their Sympathetic Name. The &quot;Scroll of Going Forth by Night&quot; or &quot;the Hand of U'mat&quot; may or may not be that object's Sympathetic Name, you'd have to test it by casting a spell with it to find out.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Is this enjoyable or frustrating for you guys? Would you like me to do something differently? I like writing scenes like this more than what we'd been mostly doing so far, but I don't want to put unfun hurdles in your way. In case it wasn't clear, my plan for this chapter is about the journey and the process at least as much as the Hand itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T20:53:42-07:00","id":1067365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1067356#post1067356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couple of rules reminders so everyone knows the stakes:<br /> <br /> Regardless of the method you use, searching the Red Land for your destination [as opposed to colocating there directly, which you have no way of doing right now] will be an extended Stamina+Survival roll with various penalties and bonuses and a currently unknown target number.<br /> <br /> The mechanical effect of bringing Asyut along, which is optional, is to allow the primary actor 2 additional rolls on top of their Stamina+Survival rating.<br /> <br /> The mechanical effect of bringing a Shadow along, also optional, is to give you a 3-dot Retainer (6 dice) which can assist the above roll, help out in combat, and other actions.<br /> <br /> Also, about Sympathy: targeting something sympathetically requires a Sympathetic Connection <b><i>and </i></b>a Sympathy Yantra. Space 2 &quot;Borrow Threads&quot; is a good way to get connections if you know someone who has them naturally, but Yantras can be a little harder as you need a piece of the target, or at least a good physical representation of them or their Sympathetic Name. The &quot;Scroll of Going Forth by Night&quot; or &quot;the Hand of U'mat&quot; may or may not be that object's Sympathetic Name, you'd have to test it by casting a spell with it to find out.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Is this enjoyable or frustrating for you guys? Would you like me to do something differently? I like writing scenes like this more than what we'd been mostly doing so far, but I don't want to put unfun hurdles in your way. In case it wasn't clear, my plan for this chapter is about the journey and the process at least as much as the Hand itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually fairly certain the sleeping mummy has a sympathetic tie to the scroll, and even if I can't touch it without waking it up, I can chain through the vampire to borrow it.<br /> <br /> As for the Yantra, a symbolic yantra can be a drawing or caricature. So if the vamp can describe what it looks like we can make a drawing of it and should be fine.<br /> <br /> I was hoping one or both of the vamp or the mummy had a line directly to the Hand, but I wasn't holding out hope.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T02:13:05-07:00","id":1067460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1047257-ooc-awakening-2e-to-the-strongest?p=1067356#post1067356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couple of rules reminders so everyone knows the stakes:<br /> <br /> Regardless of the method you use, searching the Red Land for your destination [as opposed to colocating there directly, which you have no way of doing right now] will be an extended Stamina+Survival roll with various penalties and bonuses and a currently unknown target number.<br /> <br /> The mechanical effect of bringing Asyut along, which is optional, is to allow the primary actor 2 additional rolls on top of their Stamina+Survival rating.<br /> <br /> The mechanical effect of bringing a Shadow along, also optional, is to give you a 3-dot Retainer (6 dice) which can assist the above roll, help out in combat, and other actions.<br /> <br /> Also, about Sympathy: targeting something sympathetically requires a Sympathetic Connection <b><i>and </i></b>a Sympathy Yantra. Space 2 &quot;Borrow Threads&quot; is a good way to get connections if you know someone who has them naturally, but Yantras can be a little harder as you need a piece of the target, or at least a good physical representation of them or their Sympathetic Name. The &quot;Scroll of Going Forth by Night&quot; or &quot;the Hand of U'mat&quot; may or may not be that object's Sympathetic Name, you'd have to test it by casting a spell with it to find out.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Is this enjoyable or frustrating for you guys? Would you like me to do something differently? I like writing scenes like this more than what we'd been mostly doing so far, but I don't want to put unfun hurdles in your way. In case it wasn't clear, my plan for this chapter is about the journey and the process at least as much as the Hand itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>If we take Asyut with or not the money is spent correct?<br /> <br /> As for co-locating to the Hand I have a question. If the Master is dreaming and we were able to enter those dreams, ask of the hand and he show us in the dream would that be enough to co-locate there. I don't know if we have those capabilities but I thought I would throw that out there.<br /> <br /> I checked my Character sheet and Hasty is his Vice so I believe that I was acting within my Vice to rush down there and try to force the negotiations along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T14:10:27-07:00","id":1070289,"title":"","content":"Is this game dead, we have only heard from 2 players out of 4 and no ST posts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T16:25:18-07:00","id":1070372,"title":"","content":"I was waiting for the ST, since my questions about the scroll have already been asked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T16:46:00-07:00","id":1070382,"title":"","content":"I think the ST is waiting for the person that is running the Negotiations and taking to the shadow to verbally accept the offer. Two of us have stated that we agree with the offer in the telepathy circle. i would say that the offer is acceptable but I am not the one negotiating at this point. i would have been the one negotiating if my spell had been allowed to go off and capture it then i could make the deal for its release.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T00:22:31-07:00","id":1070510,"title":"","content":"Unbound asked a question verbally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T10:44:49-07:00","id":1070739,"title":"","content":"Yes, I think we impliedly accepted the offer as it currently stands. My questions are aimed at providing some context to the Scroll chase, because if we are to find it for the Shadows we need to know those things.<br /> <br /> So it'd be nice to move on, I think we are ready for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-02T07:25:22-07:00","id":1072013,"title":"","content":"Well sorry all it looks like we have been abandoned without so much as a &quot;sorry I can't continue&quot;. I was enjoying the game if I find another that has room I will be glad to let that ST know that there are others looking for a game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/